#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:22
msgid "Ranged 7x3 fire, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>magical</ref></i>."
msgstr ""
"Menzilli 7x3 ateş, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>büyülü</ref></i>."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:29
msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Kalkan"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:31
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>8 XP</span> to gain an additional "
"<i>20% terrain defense</i> (chance to evade) until the start\n"
"          of your next turn or until cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Bir sonraki elinin başına kadar ya da iptal edilene kadar ek <i>%20 arazi "
"savunması</i> (kaçınma şansı) kazanmak için\n"
"          <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>8 TP</span> harca."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:39
msgid "Panacea"
msgstr "Her Derde Deva"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:41
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>8xp</span> to fully heal the "
"lowest-health adjacent human ally, and increase its\n"
"          attacks, strikes, and damage by its level. <span color='#dd0000' "
"weight='bold'>Next turn, it dies.</span>"
msgstr ""
"Bitişikteki en düşük canlı insan müttefiki tamamen iyileştirmek ve saldırı "
"sayısını, vuruşlarını ve hasarını seviyesi kadar\n"
"          artırmak için <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>8 TP</span> "
"harca. <span color='#dd0000' weight='bold'>Sonraki el ölür.</span>"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:49
msgid "Animate Mud"
msgstr "Çamuru Canlandır"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:51
msgid ""
"Learn to recruit <i><ref dst='unit_Mudcrawler'>Mudcrawlers</ref></i>. "
"Mudcrawlers gain +100% damage and XP\n"
"               while adjacent to you, but dissolve at the end of each "
"scenario."
msgstr ""
"<i><ref dst='unit_Mudcrawler'>Çamur Sürüngeni</ref></i> almayı öğren. Çamur "
"Sürüngenleri senin yanındayken +%100 hasar ve TP\n"
"               kazanır, ama her senaryonun sonunda çözülür."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:63
msgid "Chill Touch"
msgstr "Soğuk Dokunuş"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:65
msgid ""
"Melee 6x3 cold, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_slow'>slows</ref></i>. Replaces "
"your default melee attack."
msgstr ""
"Yakın dövüş 6x3 soğuk, <i><ref "
"dst='weaponspecial_slow'>yavaşlatır</ref></i>. Varsayılan yakın dövüş "
"saldırının yerini alır."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:72
msgid "Levitate"
msgstr "Havalanma"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:74
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>4 XP</span> to gain <i>flight</i> "
"and the <i><ref dst='ability_skirmisher'>skirmisher</ref></i> ability until "
"the start of your next turn or until cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Bir sonraki elinin başına kadar ya da iptal edilene kadar <i>uçuş</i> ve "
"<i><ref dst='ability_skirmisher'>avcı</ref></i> yeteneği kazanmak için "
"<span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>4 TP</span> harca."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:82
msgid "Find Familiar"
msgstr "Yardımcı Ruh Bul"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:84
msgid ""
"Begin each scenario with your trusty pet <i><ref dst='unit_Raven'>Raven</"
"ref></i>.\n"
"               Your familiar’s level and XP persist across scenarios, but "
"reset if it dies."
msgstr ""
"Her senaryoya güvenilir evcil <i><ref dst='unit_Raven'>Kuzgun</ref></i>unla "
"başla.\n"
"               Yardımcı ruhunun seviyesi ve TP’si senaryolar arasında "
"korunur, ama ölürse sıfırlanır."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:91
msgid "Mnemonic"
msgstr "Hafıza Sanatı"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:93
msgid "Whenever an adjacent ally gains XP, you gain the same amount of XP."
msgstr ""
"Bitişikteki bir müttefik TP kazandığında sen de aynı miktarda TP kazanırsın."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:105
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:171
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:222
msgid "Fireball"
msgstr "Ateş Topu"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:107
msgid "Ranged 8x4 fire, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>magical</ref></i>."
msgstr ""
"Menzilli 8x4 ateş, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>büyülü</ref></i>."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:114
msgid "Siphon"
msgstr "Emme"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:116
msgid ""
"Ranged 8x4 arcane, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>magical</ref></i> and "
"<i><ref dst='weaponspecial_drains'>drains</ref></i>."
msgstr ""
"Menzilli 8x4 gizemli, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>büyülü</ref></i> "
"ve <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_drains'>sömürür</ref></i>."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:123
msgid "Blizzard"
msgstr "Tipi"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:125
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>16 XP</span> and <span "
"color='#c06a61' style='italic'>your attack</span> to <i><ref "
"dst='weaponspecial_slows'>slow</ref></i> enemy units and freeze terrain in a "
"3-hex radius."
msgstr ""
"3 altıgen yarıçapındaki düşman birimleri <i><ref "
"dst='weaponspecial_slows'>yavaşlatmak</ref></i> ve araziyi dondurmak için "
"<span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>16 TP</span> ve <span color='#c06a61' "
"style='italic'>saldırını</span> harca."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:133
msgid "Counterspell"
msgstr "Karşı Büyü"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:135
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>16 XP</span> to <i>disallow <ref "
"dst='weaponspecial_magical'>magical</ref> attacks</i> in a 3-hex radius, "
"until cancelled.\n"
"          Disables Delfador’s spells, but not his passive skills."
msgstr ""
"İptal edilene kadar 3 altıgen yarıçapında <i><ref "
"dst='weaponspecial_magical'>büyülü</ref> saldırıları engellemek</i> için "
"<span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>16 TP</span> harca.\n"
"          Delfador’un büyülerini devre dışı bırakır, ama pasif becerilerini "
"bırakmaz."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:143
msgid "Polymorph"
msgstr "Biçim Değiştirme"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:145
msgid ""
"Transform into a <ref dst='unit_Frost Stoat Poly'>stoat</ref> (<span "
"color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>1 XP</span>), <ref dst='unit_Cave Bear "
"Poly'>bear</ref> (<span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>8 XP</span>), <ref "
"dst='unit_Giant Crab'>crab</ref> (<span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>16 "
"XP</span>), or <ref dst='unit_Roc'>roc</ref> (<span color='#00bbe6' "
"style='italic'>32 XP</span>). Lasts until cancelled.\n"
"           Replaces Delfador’s attacks, spells, and passives, but does not "
"affect hitpoints."
msgstr ""
"Bir <ref dst='unit_Frost Stoat Poly'>kakıma</ref> (<span color='#00bbe6' "
"style='italic'>1 TP</span>), <ref dst='unit_Cave Bear Poly'>ayıya</ref> "
"(<span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>8 TP</span>), <ref dst='unit_Giant "
"Crab'>yengece</ref> (<span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>16 TP</span>) ya "
"da <ref dst='unit_Roc'>zümrüdüankaya</ref> (<span color='#00bbe6' "
"style='italic'>32 TP</span>) dönüş. İptal edilene kadar sürer.\n"
"           Delfador’un saldırılarının, büyülerinin ve pasiflerinin yerini "
"alır, ama yaşam puanlarını etkilemez."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:157
msgid "Glamour"
msgstr "Göz Boyama"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:159
msgid "Gain the <i><ref dst='ability_leadership'>leadership</ref></i> ability."
msgstr "<i><ref dst='ability_leadership'>Liderlik</ref></i> yeteneği kazan."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:173
msgid ""
"Ranged 12x4 fire, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>magical</ref></i>."
msgstr ""
"Menzilli 12x4 ateş, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>büyülü</ref></i>."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:180
msgid "Dancing Daggers"
msgstr "Dans Eden Hançerler"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:182
msgid ""
"Ranged 5x8 blade, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_backstab'>backstab</ref></i>"
msgstr ""
"Menzilli 5x8 kesme, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_backstab'>sırttan "
"bıçaklama</ref></i>"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:189
msgid "Enthrall"
msgstr "Büyüleme"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:191
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>48 XP</span> and <span "
"color='#c06a61' style='italic'>your attack</span> to magically disguise "
"yourself as an awe-inspiring drake.\n"
"          Enemies in a 2-hex radius suffer a -10% penalty to both their "
"terrain defense\n"
"          (chance to evade) and chance to hit (except for magical attacks). "
"Lasts until cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Kendini büyüyle huşu uyandıran bir ejder kılığına sokmak için <span "
"color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>48 TP</span> ve <span color='#c06a61' "
"style='italic'>saldırını</span> harca.\n"
"          2 altıgen yarıçapındaki düşmanlar hem arazi savunmalarında\n"
"          (kaçınma şansı) hem de isabet şanslarında (büyülü saldırılar "
"hariç) -%10 ceza alır. İptal edilene kadar sürer."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:199
msgid "Animate Fire"
msgstr "Ateşi Canlandır"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:201
msgid ""
"Learn to recruit <i><ref dst='unit_Fire Guardian'>Fire Guardians</ref></i>. "
"Fire Guardians gain +100% damage and XP\n"
"               while adjacent to you, but dissipate at the end of each "
"scenario."
msgstr ""
"<i><ref dst='unit_Fire Guardian'>Ateş Muhafızı</ref></i> almayı öğren. Ateş "
"Muhafızları senin yanındayken +%100 hasar ve TP\n"
"               kazanır, ama her senaryonun sonunda dağılır."

#. [floating_text]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:208
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:475
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/utils/spellcasting.cfg:1823
msgid "Contingency"
msgstr "İhtiyat"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:210
msgid ""
"Whenever one of your human soldiers dies, they are instead returned safely "
"to your recall list."
msgstr ""
"İnsan askerlerinden biri öldüğünde, onun yerine güvenle geri çağırma "
"listene döner."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:224
msgid ""
"Ranged 17x4 fire, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>magical</ref></i>."
msgstr ""
"Menzilli 17x4 ateş, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>büyülü</ref></i>."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:231
msgid "Chain Lightning"
msgstr "Zincirleme Şimşek"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:233
msgid ""
"Ranged 14x3 fire, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>magical</ref></i>. "
"This attack can be used multiple times on offense, but\n"
"              consecutive uses strike one fewer time."
msgstr ""
"Menzilli 14x3 ateş, <i><ref dst='weaponspecial_magical'>büyülü</ref></i>. "
"Bu saldırı saldırıda birden çok kez kullanılabilir, ama\n"
"              art arda kullanımlar bir kez daha az vurur."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:240
msgid "Time Dilation"
msgstr "Zaman Genişlemesi"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:242
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>48 XP</span> to grant yourself "
"and all allies double movement and a second attack this turn.\n"
"          When this turn ends, affected units become <ref "
"dst='weaponspecial_slows'>slowed</ref>."
msgstr ""
"Bu el kendine ve bütün müttefiklerine çift hareket ve ikinci bir saldırı "
"vermek için <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>48 TP</span> harca.\n"
"          Bu el bittiğinde etkilenen birimler <ref "
"dst='weaponspecial_slows'>yavaşlatılmış</ref> olur."

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:250
msgid "Cataclysm"
msgstr "Kıyamet"

#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/skill_set.lua:252
msgid ""
"Spend <span color='#00bbe6' style='italic'>99 XP</span> and <span "
"color='#c06a61' style='italic'>your attack</span> to blast everything in a 5-"
"hex radius. Units (except Delfador) will be reduced\n"
"          to 1 HP. Dries water, melts snow, burns forest, and levels castles/"
"villages."
msgstr ""
"5 altıgen yarıçapındaki her şeyi havaya uçurmak için <span color='#00bbe6' "
"style='italic'>99 TP</span> ve <span color='#c06a61' "
"style='italic'>saldırını</span> harca. Birimler (Delfador hariç)\n"
"          1 YP’ye düşer. Suyu kurutur, karı eritir, ormanı yakar, "
"kaleleri/köyleri yerle bir eder."

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:49
msgid "Cast Delfador’s Spells"
msgstr "Delfador’un Büyülerini Yap"

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:49
msgid "Select Delfador’s Spells"
msgstr "Delfador’un Büyülerini Seç"

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:50
msgid "Cast the Apprentice’s Spells"
msgstr "Çırağın Büyülerini Yap"

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:50
msgid "Select the Apprentice’s Spells"
msgstr "Çırağın Büyülerini Seç"

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:56
msgid ""
"<span size='small'><i>Delfador knows many useful spells, and will learn more "
"as he levels-up automatically throughout the campaign. Delfador does not use "
"XP to level-up. Instead,\n"
"Delfador uses XP to cast certain spells. If you select spells that cost XP, "
"<b>double- or right-click on Delfador to cast them</b>. You can only cast 1 "
"spell per turn.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span size='small'><i>Delfador pek çok faydalı büyü bilir ve seferberlik "
"boyunca otomatik olarak seviye atladıkça daha fazlasını öğrenir. Delfador "
"seviye atlamak için TP kullanmaz. Bunun yerine\n"
"Delfador TP’yi belirli büyüleri yapmak için kullanır. TP harcayan büyüler "
"seçersen, <b>onları yapmak için Delfador’a çift tıkla ya da sağ tıkla</b>. "
"Her elde yalnızca 1 büyü yapabilirsin.</i></span>"

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:57
msgid ""
"<span size='small'><i>The apprentice knows several useful spells, and will "
"learn more as he levels-up automatically throughout the campaign. The "
"apprentice does not use XP to level-up. Instead,\n"
"he uses XP to cast certain spells. If you select spells that cost XP,"
"<b>double- or right-click on the apprentice to cast them</b>. You can only "
"cast 1 spell per turn.</i></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span size='small'><i>Çırak birkaç faydalı büyü bilir ve seferberlik "
"boyunca otomatik olarak seviye atladıkça daha fazlasını öğrenir. Çırak "
"seviye atlamak için TP kullanmaz. Bunun yerine\n"
"TP’yi belirli büyüleri yapmak için kullanır. TP harcayan büyüler seçersen, "
"<b>onları yapmak için çırağa çift tıkla ya da sağ tıkla</b>. Her elde "
"yalnızca 1 büyü yapabilirsin.</i></span>"

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:131
msgid "Confirm Spells <small><i>(can be changed every scenario)</i></small>"
msgstr "Büyüleri Onayla <small><i>(her senaryoda değiştirilebilir)</i></small>"

#. [lua]: display_skills_dialog
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/spellcasting.lua:134
msgid "Choose Later"
msgstr "Sonra Seç"

#. [lua]: wesnoth.interface.game_display.unit_status
#. [chance_to_hit]: id=skill_illusion
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/lua/theme.lua:13
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/utils/spellcasting.cfg:1489
msgid ""
"dazed: This unit is dazed. It suffers a -10% penalty to both its defense and "
"chance to hit (except for magical attacks)."
msgstr ""
"sersemlemiş: Bu birim sersemlemiş. Hem savunmasında hem isabet şansında "
"-%10 ceza alır (büyülü saldırılar hariç)."

#. [scenario]: id=00_Graduation
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:6
msgid "Graduation"
msgstr "Mezuniyet"

#. [leader]: type=Delfador L1
#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:20
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:208
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:210
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:213
msgid "Apprentice"
msgstr "Çırak"

#. [side]
#. [side]: id=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:26
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:34
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:59
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:26
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:33
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:41
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:43
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:28
msgid "Isle of Alduin"
msgstr "Alduin Adası"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:41
msgid "Summoned Monsters"
msgstr "Çağrılmış Canavarlar"

#. [message]
#. an informational plaque on a statue of a female arch-mage
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:84
msgid ""
"<i>In honor of master Heryera, who gave her life in defense of Elensefar "
"against the lich Ras-Tabahn.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Elensefar’ı umacı Ras-Tabahn’a karşı savunurken canını veren usta "
"Herira’nın anısına.</i>"

#. [unit]: id=Leollyn
#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:182
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:249
msgid "Leollyn"
msgstr "Leollin"

#. [unit]: id=Saegwylyn, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:200
msgid "Saegwylyn"
msgstr "Saegvilin"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:234
msgid "The Author"
msgstr "Yazar"

#. [message]
#. notice that appears at the beginning of the scenario if you select Deadly difficulty
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:239
msgid ""
"NOTE: ‘Deadly’ difficulty is intended to be a frighteningly difficult "
"challenge even for experienced players! If you’re new to Wesnoth, I strongly "
"suggest trying a lower difficulty."
msgstr ""
"NOT: ‘Ölümcül’ zorluk deneyimli oyuncular için bile korkutucu derecede zor "
"bir sınav olacak şekilde tasarlanmıştır! Vesnot’ta yeniyseniz daha düşük "
"bir zorluk denemenizi şiddetle öneririm."

#. [message]
#. notice that appears at the beginning of the scenario if you select Hard difficulty
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:246
msgid ""
"NOTE: ‘Hard’ difficulty is intended to be a serious challenge even for "
"experienced players! If you’re new to Wesnoth, you may want to try a lower "
"difficulty."
msgstr ""
"NOT: ‘Zor’ seviye deneyimli oyuncular için bile ciddi bir sınav olacak "
"şekilde tasarlanmıştır! Vesnot’ta yeniyseniz daha düşük bir zorluk denemek "
"isteyebilirsiniz."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. the fire wraiths are not visible yet. Delfador is about to appear on the left edge of the map
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:255
msgid "Faster, faster! The wraiths will soon be upon you!"
msgstr "Daha hızlı, daha hızlı! Hortlaklar birazdan tepende olacak!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. referencing events that happened minutes before the beginning of the campaign
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:270
msgid ""
"Hey, how was I supposed to know the halfway cave was warded! All I did was "
"throw a few celebratory firebolts! For the spectators, you know?"
msgstr ""
"Hey, yarı yoldaki mağaranın korumalı olduğunu nereden bilecektim! Tek "
"yaptığım birkaç kutlama ateş oku atmaktı! Seyirciler için, anlarsın ya?"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. there's a blue orb at the east edge of the map, which will dispel the fire guardians that will soon appear to chase Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:275
msgid "Just hurry and get to the dispel orb!"
msgstr "Sadece acele et de dağıtma küresine ulaş!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:283
msgid "Reach the blue orb at the east edge of the map"
msgstr "Haritanın doğu kenarındaki mavi küreye ulaş"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#. Delfador is currently just named "apprentice". He doesn't get his name until scenario 2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:288
msgid "Death of the Apprentice"
msgstr "Çırağın ölümü"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. this tells the player that 1) Delfador is Methor's apprentice, and 2) Delfador is very reckless
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:306
msgid ""
"Out of all the masters in Alduin, why did the sages curse me with the most "
"reckless apprentice in all Wesnoth?"
msgstr ""
"Alduin’deki onca usta arasından bilgeler neden beni bütün Vesnot’un en "
"pervasız çırağıyla lanetledi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. this line is spoken as soon as the fire guardians enter the map
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:324
msgid "The wraiths are catching up! Keep moving!"
msgstr "Hortlaklar yetişiyor! İlerlemeye devam et!"

#. [message]: speaker=Saegwylyn
#. another of Delfador's instructors; implying Delfador has attempted to firebolt the fire guardians before, and it ended badly
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:329
msgid "10 copper says he tries to firebolt them again..."
msgstr "10 bakırına bahse girerim onlara yine ateş oku atmaya çalışacak..."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. Levitate is one of many spells that Delfador will have access to throughout this scenario. It grants him flight and skirmisher, which
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:334
msgid ""
"Ignore her. You’re making good time so far — now cast Levitate and slip past "
"the eyestalks! You may need to cast it several turns in a row to keep ahead "
"of the wraiths."
msgstr ""
"Onu boş ver. Şimdiye kadar iyi bir hız yapıyorsun — şimdi Havalanma "
"büyüsünü yap ve göz saplarının yanından sıyrıl! Hortlakların önünde kalmak "
"için birkaç el üst üste yapman gerekebilir."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:338
msgid "Levitate? Master, are you sure?"
msgstr "Havalanma mı? Usta, emin misiniz?"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:342
msgid ""
"Oh for the love of— remember what happened last time you tried to fight? "
"Just do it!"
msgstr ""
"Aman Tanrım— en son savaşmaya çalıştığında ne olduğunu hatırla! Sadece yap!"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:347
msgid "Casting Spells:"
msgstr "Büyü Yapma:"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:348
msgid "Double- or right-click on the apprentice to cast spells."
msgstr "Büyü yapmak için çırağa çift tıkla ya da sağ tıkla."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. spoken after Delfador attacks the fire guardians, referencing the "10 copper" bet from earlier. Since there are 3 guardians and they have 50% fire resistance, this is not a wise move by Delfador.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:365
msgid "All right, all right! It’s just as you said."
msgstr "Tamam, tamam! Tam dediğiniz gibi."

#. [message]: speaker=Saegwylyn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:370
msgid "10 more copper for me!"
msgstr "Bana 10 bakır daha!"

#. [message]: speaker=Saegwylyn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:383
msgid ""
"So he does know proper magic after all. It only took four failed exams..."
msgstr "Demek düzgün büyü biliyormuş. Sadece dört başarısız sınav sürdü..."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. if the levitate spell ends over impassable terrain (like lava), Delfador dies
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:397
msgid ""
"Almost there! Just fly across the chasm and touch the orb — and make sure "
"your levitate spell doesn’t end over lava!"
msgstr ""
"Neredeyse geldin! Sadece uçurumun üzerinden uç ve küreye dokun — ve "
"havalanma büyünün lavın üzerinde bitmediğinden emin ol!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:411
msgid "Hello, my adoring fans!"
msgstr "Merhaba, beni seven hayranlarım!"

#. [message]: speaker=Mirya
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:415
msgid "Hey, what’re you doing! This isn’t the normal route!"
msgstr "Hey, ne yapıyorsun! Bu normal yol değil!"

#. [message]: speaker=Rolyn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:419
msgid "We’d better get out of here. Remember what happened on his last exam?"
msgstr "Buradan gitsek iyi olur. Son sınavında ne olduğunu hatırlıyor musun?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador has just reached the end of the obstacle course / final exam (and the end of the scenario0
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:539
msgid "Yes! I’ve made it! This time has to be good enough."
msgstr "Evet! Başardım! Bu sefer yeterince iyi olmalı."

#. [message]: speaker=Leollyn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:544
msgid "Well, what do you think?"
msgstr "Eee, ne düşünüyorsunuz?"

#. [message]: speaker=Saegwylyn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:550
msgid ""
"I say no. A mage needs wisdom; this apprentice cares only for his own "
"amusement. This one is a petty magician, not a wise sage or advisor of kings."
msgstr ""
"Ben hayır diyorum. Bir büyücünün bilgeliğe ihtiyacı vardır; bu çırak "
"yalnızca kendi eğlencesini önemsiyor. Bu adi bir hokkabaz, bilge bir âlim "
"ya da kralların danışmanı değil."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:554
msgid ""
"I say yes. I admit my apprentice enjoys the spotlight more than most, but "
"with this much magical aptitude who wouldn’t want to show off?"
msgstr ""
"Ben evet diyorum. Çırağımın ilgi odağı olmayı çoğundan fazla sevdiğini "
"kabul ediyorum, ama bu kadar büyü yeteneği olan kim gösteriş yapmak istemez?"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:558
msgid ""
"I think it’s obvious this is one of the most gifted magi we’ve trained in "
"years. The skill is innate; the wisdom will come with time."
msgstr ""
"Bence bunun yıllardır yetiştirdiğimiz en yetenekli büyücülerden biri olduğu "
"açık. Beceri doğuştan; bilgelik zamanla gelir."

#. [message]: speaker=Leollyn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:563
msgid "So mine is the deciding vote. Very well, I’ve made up my mind."
msgstr "Demek belirleyici oy benim. Pekâlâ, kararımı verdim."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. non sequitur. The screen has faded to black, and Delfador is hearing a voice with no apparent origin. In scenario 4, this is later revealed to be the elvish seer Elende, prophesying about Delfador's future.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:590
msgid ""
"<i>The Deceiver weaves the twine encircling the puppets in the court of "
"royals.</i>"
msgstr "<i>Aldatıcı, kraliyet sarayındaki kuklaları saran ipliği örer.</i>"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:594
msgid ""
"<i>Fatherless prince and sovereignless king, the balance of man hangs upon "
"this thread.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Babasız prens ve hükümdarsız kral, insanlığın dengesi bu ipliğe "
"bağlı.</i>"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:598
msgid ""
"<i>Should force and fire brandish themselves where wisdom and pity are left "
"wanting, this string of fate shall inexorably be sundered.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Bilgeliğin ve merhametin eksik kaldığı yerde güç ve ateş kendini "
"gösterirse, bu kader ipliği kaçınılmaz olarak kopacak.</i>"

#. [message]: speaker=Leollyn
#. the screen has faded back to normal, and master Leollyn is annoyed that Delfador wasn't paying attention
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:611
msgid "Apprentice! Are you listening? I’m trying to congratulate you!"
msgstr "Çırak! Dinliyor musun? Seni tebrik etmeye çalışıyorum!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:615
msgid "But who— what— um, yes, I must have drifted off."
msgstr "Ama kim— ne— ee, evet, dalıp gitmiş olmalıyım."

#. [message]: speaker=Leollyn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:619
msgid ""
"...as I was saying... apprentice, congratulations on your successful "
"completion of the practical portion of your graduation exam! Now we proceed "
"to the written section; please conjure your quill and parchment..."
msgstr ""
"...diyordum ki... çırak, mezuniyet sınavının uygulamalı kısmını başarıyla "
"tamamladığın için tebrikler! Şimdi yazılı kısma geçiyoruz; lütfen kalemini "
"ve parşömenini büyüyle çağır..."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador has just taken lethal damage
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:639
msgid "Oh no! Master, help!"
msgstr "Ah hayır! Usta, yardım edin!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. Methor casts a spell to save Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:644
msgid "I’ll save you!"
msgstr "Seni kurtaracağım!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/00_Graduation.cfg:659
msgid ""
"(sigh) Not again! I suppose you’ll have to retry the exam next year... for "
"the sixth time."
msgstr ""
"(iç çeker) Yine mi! Sanırım sınava gelecek yıl yeniden girmen gerekecek... "
"altıncı kez."

#. [scenario]: id=01_Stirrings_of_War
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:10
msgid "Stirrings of War"
msgstr "Savaşın Kıpırtıları"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:28
msgid ""
"In the year 481 after the founding of Wesnoth, King Garard the Second grew "
"discontent."
msgstr ""
"Vesnot’un kuruluşundan sonraki 481. yılda Kral İkinci Garard huzursuzlandı."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:31
msgid ""
"With the Estmarks secured and the southern bandits pacified, his empire had "
"grown large and powerful. Garard’s marriage to the young Asheviere had "
"secured him a queen, as well as the promise of an heir. Yet despite these "
"achievements, the restless king could find no peace."
msgstr ""
"Doğu Sınırları güvenceye alınıp güneydeki haydutlar yatıştırılınca "
"imparatorluğu büyük ve güçlü olmuştu. Garard’ın genç Aşivye ile evliliği "
"ona hem bir kraliçe hem de bir varis vaadi sağlamıştı. Ama bu başarılara "
"rağmen huzursuz kral bir türlü huzur bulamıyordu."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:35
msgid ""
"The king’s love lay in sword and shield, in battle and blood. Dissatisfied "
"with a life of languor among the estates of Weldyn, Garard looked instead to "
"the orcs of the Heart Mountains, whose raids had long been a nuisance across "
"his northern border."
msgstr ""
"Kralın sevgisi kılıçta ve kalkanda, savaşta ve kandaydı. Weldyn’in "
"malikânelerindeki uyuşuk hayattan memnun olmayan Garard, gözünü uzun "
"zamandır kuzey sınırı boyunca baş belası olan baskınlarıyla Yürek "
"Dağları’nın orklarına çevirdi."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:39
msgid ""
"Eager to retaliate, the king sent messengers far and wide. He called to arms "
"an expeditionary force to cross the Great River and lay claim to orcish "
"lands; a great show of power to secure Wesnoth’s might."
msgstr ""
"Karşılık vermeye hevesli kral dört bir yana ulaklar gönderdi. Büyük Nehir’i "
"geçip ork topraklarını sahiplenmek için bir sefer kuvvetini silah altına "
"çağırdı; Vesnot’un kudretini pekiştirecek büyük bir güç gösterisi."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:43
msgid ""
"One of these messengers rode to the venerable Academy of Magic on Alduin, "
"summoning a contingent of magi to support Garard’s endeavor. A particular "
"young apprentice was especially enthusiastic..."
msgstr ""
"Bu ulaklardan biri, Garard’ın girişimini desteklemek için bir büyücü "
"birliği çağırmak üzere Alduin’deki saygın Büyü Akademisi’ne gitti. Genç bir "
"çırak özellikle hevesliydi..."

#. [side]: type=Orcish Grunt, id=Ozgob
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:70
msgid "Ozgob"
msgstr "Ozgob"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Grunt, id=Ozgob
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:78
msgid "Clan Whitefang"
msgstr "Akdiş Klanı"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:122
msgid "Weldyn"
msgstr "Weldyn"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:143
msgid "15 gold"
msgstr "15 altın"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:143
msgid "Treasure! Looks like a previous victim of the goblins."
msgstr "Hazine! Görünüşe göre goblinlerin daha önceki bir kurbanı."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:180
msgid "Are we there yet?"
msgstr "Vardık mı?"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. a "seeker spell" is a made-up word to describe some kind of spell that helps you find your way to a destination
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:185
msgid ""
"Nearer than the last time you asked, yet further than we will be the next. "
"Really apprentice, would it kill you to learn a proper seeker spell?"
msgstr ""
"En son sorduğundan daha yakın, ama bir dahaki sorduğundan daha uzak. "
"Gerçekten çırak, düzgün bir arama büyüsü öğrensen ölür müsün?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador has never met King Garard II, but rather idolizes him
#. "no need to be so glum" is echoed by Methor in S13x
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:191
msgid ""
"There’s no need to be so glum, master. As the head of our delegation, you’ll "
"even get to counsel with the king himself! What I wouldn’t give for a chance "
"to prove myself to him..."
msgstr ""
"Bu kadar suratsız olmanıza gerek yok, usta. Heyetimizin başı olarak kralın "
"kendisiyle bile danışacaksınız! Kendimi ona kanıtlama fırsatı için neler "
"vermezdim..."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:195
msgid "Do you hear that?"
msgstr "Duyuyor musunuz?"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:195
msgid "Quiet!"
msgstr "Sessiz!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ozgob
#. 'stragglers' refers to soldiers (like Delfador and Methor) who are joining Garard's war-camp, but are arriving late
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:205
msgid ""
"“Kill the stragglers”, they says. “You’ll have our best warriors”, they "
"says. N’ all I get are a bunch o’ lousy goblins? Lousy lazy lying—"
msgstr ""
"“Geride kalanları öldürün”, diyorlar. “En iyi savaşçılarımız senin olacak”, "
"diyorlar. Bana kalan da bir avuç berbat goblin mi? Berbat tembel yalancı—"

#. [message]: role=gobbo1
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:210
msgid "They’re here, they’re here! Humans on the clan road!"
msgstr "Buradalar, buradalar! Klan yolunda insanlar!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ozgob
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:214
msgid ""
"—then grab your spear, you loathsome lout! Don’t let them link up with the "
"rest of their army!"
msgstr ""
"—o zaman al mızrağını, seni iğrenç hödük! Ordularının geri kalanıyla "
"birleşmelerine izin verme!"

#. [message]: role=gobbo1
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:218
msgid "No, no, no! No fight! I run away!"
msgstr "Hayır, hayır, hayır! Dövüş yok! Ben kaçar!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ozgob
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:225
msgid "Why you runtish, yellow—"
msgstr "Seni bodur, korkak—"

#. [message]
#. multiple goblins are running away
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:232
msgid "Wait for me!"
msgstr "Beni bekleyin!"

#. [message]: role=gobbo3
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:236
msgid "Run away! Back to the swamp!"
msgstr "Kaçın! Bataklığa geri!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ozgob
#. Ozgob has just killed one of the fleeing goblins
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:244
msgid "I said FORM RANKS! Rousers, get these runts organized!"
msgstr "SAF TUTUN dedim! Kışkırtıcılar, şu bodurları düzene sokun!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:248
msgid "Gumpnug"
msgstr "Gumpnug"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:263
msgid "Bork"
msgstr "Bork"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:279
msgid "Mirnik"
msgstr "Mirnik"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:295
msgid "Gump"
msgstr "Gump"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:315
msgid "Defeat Ozgob"
msgstr "Ozgob’u yen"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:319
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:325
msgid "Death of Methor or the Apprentice"
msgstr "Methor’un ya da Çırağın ölümü"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:327
msgid "Defeat a Goblin Rouser to rout their entourage."
msgstr "Maiyetini bozguna uğratmak için bir Goblin Kışkırtıcıyı yen."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:344
msgid "Choosing Spells:"
msgstr "Büyü Seçme:"

#. [object]
#. Delfador does not yet have a true name; he's only called "apprentice"
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:346
msgid ""
"Before each scenario in this campaign, you will have the opportunity to "
"select which spells to equip for the upcoming battle. Remember, double- or "
"right-click on the apprentice to cast chosen spells!"
msgstr ""
"Bu seferberlikte her senaryodan önce yaklaşan savaş için hangi büyüleri "
"kuşanacağını seçme fırsatın olacak. Unutma, seçilen büyüleri yapmak için "
"çırağa çift tıkla ya da sağ tıkla!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. Methor says this when Delfador stands on their keep. Delfador can only recruit mudcrawlers; Methor recruits mages
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:369
msgid ""
"You’re not yet a journeyman, apprentice! Your mudcrawlers are not without "
"use, but to recruit mages I’ll need to stand on our keep."
msgstr ""
"Henüz kalfa değilsin, çırak! Çamur sürüngenlerin işe yaramaz değil, ama "
"büyücü almak için burcumuzda durmam gerekecek."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. Methor says this when Delfador stands on their keep. Delfador can not recruit; Methor recruits mages
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:376
msgid ""
"You’re not yet a journeyman, apprentice! To recruit mages I’ll need to stand "
"on our keep."
msgstr ""
"Henüz kalfa değilsin, çırak! Büyücü almak için burcumuzda durmam gerekecek."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:388
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:546
msgid "New Recruit:"
msgstr "Yeni Asker:"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:389
msgid ""
"The apprentice is the main character of this campaign, but right now he’s "
"not your leader. Methor is your leader, and he can recruit Mages."
msgstr ""
"Çırak bu seferberliğin ana karakteri, ama şu anda liderin o değil. Liderin "
"Methor ve o Büyücü alabilir."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:391
msgid ""
"Mages are deadly ranged attackers, with accurate <i>magical</i> attacks that "
"are difficult to evade. They have few hitpoints and are highly vulnerable in "
"melee combat, so take good care of them!"
msgstr ""
"Büyücüler, kaçınılması zor, isabetli <i>büyülü</i> saldırılara sahip "
"ölümcül menzilli saldırganlardır. Yaşam puanları azdır ve yakın dövüşte çok "
"savunmasızdırlar, o yüzden onlara iyi bak!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:404
msgid ""
"<i>Rain is purely visual, and has no impact on gameplay. If rain is "
"distracting or reduces performance, you can disable it by opening the "
"Preferences menu (Ctrl-P), selecting “Display”, and unchecking “Animate "
"Map.”</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Yağmur tamamen görseldir ve oyuna hiçbir etkisi yoktur. Yağmur dikkatini "
"dağıtıyor ya da performansı düşürüyorsa Tercihler menüsünü açıp (Ctrl-P) "
"“Görüntü”yü seçerek ve “Haritayı Canlandır” seçeneğinin işaretini "
"kaldırarak kapatabilirsin.</i>"

#. [scenario]: id=01_Stirrings_of_War
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:493
msgid "Run for your lives!"
msgstr "Canını seven kaçsın!"

#. [scenario]: id=01_Stirrings_of_War
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:494
msgid "Run! Flee back to the swamp!"
msgstr "Kaçın! Bataklığa geri kaçın!"

#. [scenario]: id=01_Stirrings_of_War
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:495
msgid "Noooo, $unit.name!"
msgstr "Hayııır, $unit.name!"

#. [scenario]: id=01_Stirrings_of_War
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:496
msgid "Flee, flee! $unit.name’s dead!"
msgstr "Kaçın, kaçın! $unit.name öldü!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ozgob
#. said in response to goblins running away from the fight
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:503
msgid "Cowards!! Fight and die like real orcish warriors!"
msgstr "Korkaklar!! Gerçek ork savaşçıları gibi savaşın ve ölün!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. said after any living unit dies (both human and goblin)
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:529
msgid ""
"(sigh) More casualties of pointless politics. I joined the order to do some "
"<i><b>good</b></i> in the world..."
msgstr ""
"(iç çeker) Anlamsız siyasetin daha fazla kurbanı. Ben tarikata dünyada "
"biraz <i><b>iyilik</b></i> yapmak için katılmıştım..."

#. [message]: speaker=Ozgob
#. Ozgob has lost most of his goblins ('runts'), and is about to charge at Delfador personally
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:542
msgid ""
"I’ve had it with this! Never send a runt to do a warrior’s job. I’ll bring "
"you down myself!"
msgstr ""
"Bıktım bundan! Bir savaşçının işini asla bir bodura yaptırma. Seni kendim "
"indireceğim!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:579
msgid ""
"We’ve accumulated a great deal of gold, apprentice. While my magic is "
"powerful on the front lines, if we’re ever struggling it’s also important "
"that I have the chance to recruit new magi from our keep."
msgstr ""
"Epey altın biriktirdik, çırak. Büyüm ön cephede güçlü olsa da "
"zorlandığımızda burcumuzdan yeni büyücüler alma fırsatımın olması da önemli."

#. [message]
#. Ozgob has died, and any remaining goblins are deserting him
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:607
msgid "Run away!"
msgstr "Kaçın!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ozgob
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:612
msgid "Useless... goblins..."
msgstr "İşe yaramaz... goblinler..."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. King Garard has just appeared, along with a few knights
#. King Garard has just appeared, along with a few knights
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:632
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:670
msgid ""
"Ride forth, knights of Wesnoth! No orc who sets foot on our soil shall leave "
"alive!"
msgstr ""
"İleri, Vesnot şövalyeleri! Toprağımıza ayak basan hiçbir ork sağ çıkmayacak!"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. Garard came to kill the goblins, but Delfador has already done it.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:640
msgid ""
"But what’s this? It seems some magi have beaten us to battle and already "
"slain our foe! I wasn’t making a mistake bringing Alduin into the fold after "
"all. Who commands this detachment?"
msgstr ""
"Ama bu da ne? Görünüşe göre bazı büyücüler savaşa bizden önce gelip "
"düşmanımızı çoktan öldürmüş! Demek Alduin’i işin içine katmakla hata "
"etmemişim. Bu birliğe kim komuta ediyor?"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:644
msgid ""
"(bowing) My Lord, Alduin dispatched these apprentices as response to your "
"war-call. I volunteered to lead them, and I now place my medicinal arts at "
"your service."
msgstr ""
"(eğilerek) Efendim, Alduin bu çırakları savaş çağrınıza yanıt olarak "
"gönderdi. Onlara önderlik etmeye gönüllü oldum ve şimdi şifa sanatlarımı "
"hizmetinize sunuyorum."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:648
msgid ""
"A healer? Well, we’ll have need of your services soon enough. Follow me back "
"to camp. We attack on the morrow!"
msgstr ""
"Bir şifacı mı? Eh, yakında hizmetlerinize ihtiyacımız olacak. Beni kampa "
"kadar takip edin. Yarın saldırıyoruz!"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. Delfador has failed to defeat the goblins. Garard does not respect him.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:678
msgid ""
"But what’s this? Some pencil-necked magi have beaten us to battle, yet can’t "
"even finish off a few goblins! Bah, go back to Alduin, you scholars have no "
"place in war after all."
msgstr ""
"Ama bu da ne? Kalem boyunlu birkaç büyücü savaşa bizden önce gelmiş, ama "
"birkaç goblinin işini bile bitirememiş! Bah, Alduin’e dönün, siz âlimlerin "
"savaşta yeri yokmuş meğer."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/01_Stirrings_of_War.cfg:682
msgid "Now I’ll never make a name for myself..."
msgstr "Artık asla adımı duyuramayacağım..."

#. [scenario]: id=02_Fort_Garard
#. [side]: type=Halberdier, id=Luraery
#. [side]: type=Lieutenant, id=Aelyn
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:6
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/12_The_Traitor.cfg:68
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/12_The_Traitor.cfg:87
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/12_The_Traitor.cfg:102
msgid "Fort Garard"
msgstr "Garard Kalesi"

#. [side]
#. [side]: type=Goblin Pillager, id=Khavur
#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Ushnug
#. [side]: type=Orcish Slayer, id=Gusush
#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Vidrug
#. [side]: type=Orcish Crossbowman, id=Shogro
#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Khovak
#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Ghazgir
#. [side]: type=Direwolf Rider, id=Mukhu
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:38
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:53
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:149
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:165
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:181
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:60
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:78
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:91
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:56
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:75
msgid "Whitefang Orcs"
msgstr "Akdiş Orkları"

#. [side]: type=Goblin Pillager, id=Khavur
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:46
msgid "Khavur"
msgstr "Havur"

#. [side]
#. [side]: id={ID}, type={TYPE}
#. [side]: type=Longbowman
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:71
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:84
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:142
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:155
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:170
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:211
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:208
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:245
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/13_Revelry_Revisited.cfg:65
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/14_Long_Live_the_Queen.cfg:61
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/14_Long_Live_the_Queen.cfg:151
msgid "Army of Wesnoth"
msgstr "Vesnot Ordusu"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warrior, id=Ushnug
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:143
msgid "Ushnug"
msgstr "Uşnug"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Slayer, id=Gusush
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:159
msgid "Gusush"
msgstr "Gusuş"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Vidrug
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:175
msgid "Vidrug"
msgstr "Vidrug"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:267
msgid ""
"At last, here we stand on the eve of battle! Remember the plan: General "
"Lionel, soften up the orcish warriors while my knights look for an opening; "
"Methor, command the camp in my absence — those goblin raiders are still "
"being a nuisance."
msgstr ""
"Sonunda işte savaşın arifesindeyiz! Planı unutmayın: General Lionel, "
"şövalyelerim bir açıklık ararken ork savaşçılarını yumuşat; Methor, ben "
"yokken kampa komuta et — o goblin akıncıları hâlâ baş belası."

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:274
msgid ""
"M’lord, weren’ we waiting for the queen? Your wife had expressed an interest "
"in seeing an orc."
msgstr ""
"Efendim, kraliçeyi beklemiyor muyduk? Eşiniz bir ork görmeye ilgi duyduğunu "
"belirtmişti."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:278
msgid ""
"We can brook no delay, Lionel. The opposing army is finally ready for "
"pitched battle. Ere dusk, my lance will be stained with orcish blood!"
msgstr ""
"Hiçbir gecikmeye katlanamayız, Lionel. Karşı ordu nihayet meydan "
"muharebesine hazır. Akşam olmadan mızrağım ork kanına bulanacak!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:284
msgid ""
"This may prove a learning experience for you, apprentice. Keep your eyes "
"sharp as we guard the fort."
msgstr ""
"Bu senin için bir öğrenme deneyimi olabilir, çırak. Kaleyi korurken gözünü "
"dört aç."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:288
msgid ""
"The king commanded us to handle the goblins, master. We could do that by "
"guarding... or we could take a risk and assault the goblin camp."
msgstr ""
"Kral goblinlerle ilgilenmemizi emretti, usta. Bunu koruma yaparak "
"yapabiliriz... ya da risk alıp goblin kampına saldırabiliriz."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:292
msgid ""
"I know it’s not the caution you usually preach. But I want to be someone, "
"master, not just another wandering healer or village mage. Proving ourselves "
"to the king here could be the first step."
msgstr ""
"Biliyorum, genelde öğütlediğiniz temkin bu değil. Ama ben biri olmak "
"istiyorum usta; sadece gezgin bir şifacı ya da köy büyücüsü değil. Burada "
"kendimizi krala kanıtlamak ilk adım olabilir."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:296
msgid ""
"Oh, young one, whatever shall I do with you... If you want to lead the "
"guards against the goblins I won’t stop you, but I’m afraid I can’t help you "
"either. My place is here, tending to the sick and injured."
msgstr ""
"Ah, gencecik, seninle ne yapacağım ben... Muhafızlara goblinlere karşı "
"önderlik etmek istiyorsan seni durdurmam, ama korkarım sana yardım da "
"edemem. Benim yerim burası; hastalara ve yaralılara bakmak."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:313
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:443
msgid "Defeat Khavur, the goblin leader"
msgstr "Goblin lideri Havur’u yen"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:317
msgid ""
"Win before Garard defeats the orcish leader <span color='#ffffff' "
"size='small'>(probably turn 17 or 18)</span>"
msgstr ""
"Garard ork liderini yenmeden kazan <span color='#ffffff' "
"size='small'>(muhtemelen 17. ya da 18. el)</span>"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:321
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:457
msgid "Garard defeats Vidrug, the orcish leader"
msgstr "Garard ork lideri Vidrug’u yener"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:329
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:465
msgid "Death of Garard or Lionel"
msgstr "Garard’ın ya da Lionel’in ölümü"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:342
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:465
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/12_The_Traitor.cfg:455
msgid "New Recruits:"
msgstr "Yeni Askerler:"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:343
msgid ""
"Methor is now a soldier in the royal army, and has access to Wesnoth’s full "
"roster of level 1 infantry. In addition to Mages, you can recruit Spearmen, "
"Bowmen, Fencers, and Heavy Infantrymen."
msgstr ""
"Methor artık kraliyet ordusunda bir asker ve Vesnot’un 1. seviye "
"piyadelerinin tam kadrosuna erişimi var. Büyücülere ek olarak Mızrakçı, "
"Okçu, Eskirimci ve Ağır Piyade alabilirsin."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:355
msgid ""
"<i>If movement and combat are taking too long, you can enable “accelerated "
"speed” and “skip AI moves” in the Preferences menu.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>Hareket ve dövüş çok uzun sürüyorsa Tercihler menüsünde “hızlandırılmış "
"hız” ve “YZ hareketlerini atla” seçeneklerini açabilirsin.</i>"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:390
msgid ""
"We have some gold in camp, apprentice, and I am still in our keep and ready "
"to recruit. Remember to call for reinforcements if you need them."
msgstr ""
"Kampta biraz altınımız var çırak ve ben hâlâ burcumuzdayım, asker almaya "
"hazırım. İhtiyacın olursa takviye çağırmayı unutma."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. Garard's forces have just killed an orc
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:407
msgid "They fall before us!"
msgstr "Önümüzde düşüyorlar!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khavur
#. The goblin leader calls the retreat. Remaining goblins fall back to their keep, at least until dusk.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:419
msgid "Too many humans!"
msgstr "Çok fazla insan!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. the player is attacking orcs instead of working towards the main scenario objective. This unlocks an alternate objective
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:434
msgid ""
"Apprentice, what are you doing! The king commanded us to engage the goblin "
"raiders, not the main orcish army!"
msgstr ""
"Çırak, ne yapıyorsun! Kral goblin akıncılarıyla çatışmamızı emretti, ana "
"ork ordusuyla değil!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:438
msgid ""
"Lighten up! What’s the worst that could happen? If I slay enough orcs in the "
"main battle, I’m sure the king won’t mind that I abandoned my post! ...right?"
msgstr ""
"Rahatla biraz! Olabilecek en kötü şey ne? Ana savaşta yeterince ork "
"öldürürsem eminim kral görevimi bırakmama aldırmaz! ...değil mi?"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. $initial_orcs_remaining is between 8-15, $orcs_remaining is between 0-15
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:449
msgid ""
"Defeat at least $initial_orcs_remaining orcs ($orcs_remaining remaining)"
msgstr "En az $initial_orcs_remaining ork yen ($orcs_remaining kaldı)"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:453
msgid "Win before Garard defeats the orcish leader"
msgstr "Garard ork liderini yenmeden kazan"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:461
msgid "Death of Delfador or Methor"
msgstr "Delfador’un ya da Methor’un ölümü"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. a goblin has just attacked one of Garard's horsemen. Garard previously told Methor to guard against the goblins, but Delfador led the guards to battle instead
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:481
msgid ""
"What the— who let all these runts in here! I should have known that healer "
"would be too soft-hearted to deal properly with the goblins."
msgstr ""
"Bu da ne— bu bodurları buraya kim soktu! O şifacının goblinlerle düzgünce "
"uğraşamayacak kadar yufka yürekli olacağını bilmeliydim."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador (or one of his troops) has killed another orc, and completed his alternate objective
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:508
msgid "Yes! We got another one!"
msgstr "Evet! Bir tane daha haklandık!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:513
msgid "I’ve defeated so many orcs; surely the king must be impressed by now!"
msgstr "O kadar çok ork yendim ki kral şimdiye kadar etkilenmiş olmalı!"

#. [message]: speaker=Vidrug
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:518
msgid "Bah, filthy humans! This is hopeless. Whitefangs, retreat!"
msgstr "Bah, pis insanlar! Bu umutsuz. Akdişler, geri çekilin!"

#. [message]: speaker=Khavur
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:534
msgid "Nooo! Help meeee..."
msgstr "Hayııır! Yardım edin baaana..."

#. [message]: speaker=Vidrug
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:540
msgid "Bah, useless runts! This is hopeless. Whitefangs, retreat!"
msgstr "Bah, işe yaramaz bodurlar! Bu umutsuz. Akdişler, geri çekilin!"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:553
msgid ""
"Oh, what’s this? Seems one of our young magi knows how to seize the "
"initiative."
msgstr ""
"Ah, bu da ne? Görünüşe göre genç büyücülerimizden biri inisiyatif almayı "
"biliyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:557
msgid ""
"A proper war-mage is far too valuable to waste on the front lines; I may "
"have a special assignment for you. What’s your name, boy?"
msgstr ""
"Gerçek bir savaş büyücüsü ön cephede harcanmayacak kadar değerli; sana özel "
"bir görevim olabilir. Adın ne, evlat?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. said by Delfador to himself (or maybe just thought in his mind)
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:562
msgid "Commendation from the king himself! This is a dream come true."
msgstr "Kralın kendisinden övgü! Bu gerçek olan bir rüya."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador is realy excited to go with the king, but deeply respects Methor and doesn't want to dissapoint him
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:567
msgid ""
"I’d be honored, my lord! But I can’t give you my name — I’m just an "
"apprentice; Alduin has not yet assigned me one. And... I suppose I shouldn’t "
"want to leave without my master’s blessing..."
msgstr ""
"Onur duyarım, efendim! Ama size adımı veremem — ben sadece bir çırağım; "
"Alduin bana henüz bir ad vermedi. Ve... sanırım ustamın rızası olmadan "
"ayrılmak istememeliyim..."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:571
msgid ""
"By the traditions of our order, no apprentice shall venture alone; that "
"privilege is first awarded only to the journeymen!"
msgstr ""
"Tarikatımızın geleneklerine göre hiçbir çırak tek başına yola çıkamaz; bu "
"ayrıcalık önce yalnızca kalfalara verilir!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:575
msgid ""
"...but apprentice, truth be told, you’ve had a journeyman’s skill for quite "
"some time now. I was hoping to impart a little more wisdom before advancing "
"you, but now I understand that fate has other plans."
msgstr ""
"...ama çırak, doğrusunu söylemek gerekirse epey zamandır bir kalfanın "
"becerisine sahipsin. Seni yükseltmeden önce biraz daha bilgelik aktarmayı "
"umuyordum, ama şimdi kaderin başka planları olduğunu anlıyorum."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. nonsense words, sounding magical, copied from the original DM
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:607
msgid "Thorum restro targa thorum..."
msgstr "Torum restro targa torum..."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#. referencing the "Provost of the Council of Archmagi" mentioned by Delfador in HttT
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:627
msgid ""
"The light waxes bright. By the power of the high provost and the blessing of "
"the five sages, I declare you to be nameless NO LONGER!"
msgstr ""
"Işık parlıyor. Yüce başrahibin gücü ve beş bilgenin kutsamasıyla, artık "
"İSİMSİZ OLMADIĞINI ilan ediyorum!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:632
msgid "<i><b>DELFADOR</b></i> you shall be, and Delfador shall be YOU."
msgstr "<i><b>DELFADOR</b></i> olacaksın ve Delfador SEN olacaksın."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:640
msgid ""
"Delfador, open your eyes. And OPEN THEM AGAIN!\n"
"\n"
"I grieve for the apprentice I have lost, but I celebrate the journeyman "
"Wesnoth has gained. Your naming ceremony is complete."
msgstr ""
"Delfador, gözlerini aç. Ve BİR DAHA AÇ!\n"
"\n"
"Kaybettiğim çırak için yas tutuyorum, ama Vesnot’un kazandığı kalfayı "
"kutluyorum. Ad koyma törenin tamamlandı."

#. [unit]: type=Delfador L2
#. [event]
#. [event]: type=Delfador L4, id=delfador_mirror4
#. [unit]: type=Delfador L3
#. [side]
#. [unit]: type=Delfador L4
#. [event]: id=Kaylan
#. [unit]: type={TYPE}, id=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:660
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1684
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1721
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1783
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1819
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:339
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/10_Houses_of_the_Dead.cfg:23
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:1031
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/12_The_Traitor.cfg:373
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/utils/spellcasting.cfg:1210
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/utils/unified_characters.cfg:15
msgid "Delfador"
msgstr "Delfador"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:670
msgid "Del-fa-dor; Delfador! Thanks master, I like the sound of that."
msgstr "Del-fa-dor; Delfador! Teşekkürler usta, kulağa hoş geliyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:674
msgid ""
"Now farewell, Delfador, my ambitious young friend. If this is what you truly "
"want, I would never stand in your way. May we meet again in more peaceful "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Şimdi elveda Delfador, hırslı genç dostum. Gerçekten istediğin buysa asla "
"yoluna çıkmam. Daha barışçıl zamanlarda yeniden karşılaşalım."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:678
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, well done to you both. Now that that’s settled, “Delfador”, it’s "
"time to pack your bags. You have a long journey ahead of you!"
msgstr ""
"Evet, evet, ikinize de aferin. Madem bu iş halloldu, “Delfador”, eşyalarını "
"toplama zamanı. Önünde uzun bir yolculuk var!"

#. [message]: speaker=Vidrug
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:703
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:739
msgid "Bah... my kin will avenge me..."
msgstr "Bah... akrabalarım intikamımı alacak..."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:709
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:745
msgid ""
"The first line of orcs is broken! Continue forth, riders; we ride to victory!"
msgstr "Orkların ilk hattı kırıldı! İlerleyin süvariler; zafere sürüyoruz!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:714
msgid ""
"No; that’s not fair! I helped fight the orcs too; why is he going on without "
"me?"
msgstr ""
"Hayır; bu haksızlık! Orklarla savaşmaya ben de yardım ettim; neden bensiz "
"devam ediyor?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:718
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:754
msgid "Now I’ll never impress the king..."
msgstr "Artık kralı asla etkileyemeyeceğim..."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:723
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:773
msgid "He’s going on without us! Now I’ll never impress the king..."
msgstr "Bizsiz devam ediyor! Artık kralı asla etkileyemeyeceğim..."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador has killed the orcish leader, but not killed enough orcs to impress Garard and complete his alternate objective
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:750
msgid ""
"No; that’s not fair! I struck the finishing blow; why is he going on without "
"me?"
msgstr "Hayır; bu haksızlık! Son darbeyi ben vurdum; neden bensiz devam ediyor?"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/02_Fort_Garard.cfg:769
msgid ""
"The first line of orcs will soon be broken! Continue forth, riders; we ride "
"to victory!"
msgstr ""
"Orkların ilk hattı yakında kırılacak! İlerleyin süvariler; zafere sürüyoruz!"

#. [scenario]: id=03_The_Ambassador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:13
msgid "The Ambassador"
msgstr "Elçi"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:47
msgid "Woses"
msgstr "Ulu Ağaçlar"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:119
msgid ""
"When King Garard spoke of a special mission for me, I hadn’t been expecting "
"something as quiet as messenger duty."
msgstr ""
"Kral Garard benim için özel bir görevden söz ettiğinde ulaklık kadar sessiz "
"bir şey beklemiyordum."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:121
msgid ""
"But I won’t disappoint him. I am to find Wesnoth’s ambassador to Lintanir "
"Forest, and then deliver to the elves a notice."
msgstr ""
"Ama onu hayal kırıklığına uğratmayacağım. Vesnot’un Lintanir Ormanı "
"elçisini bulup sonra elflere bir bildiri iletmeliyim."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:130
msgid ""
"The elvish border should be some distance northeast of here, through this "
"cluster of trees. The undergrowth is so thick... Perhaps this is an "
"opportunity to practice my new fire spell."
msgstr ""
"Elf sınırı buranın biraz kuzeydoğusunda, bu ağaç kümesinin içinden geçince "
"olmalı. Çalılık o kadar sık ki... Belki yeni ateş büyümü denemek için bir "
"fırsattır."

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:163
msgid "Eldebetam"
msgstr "Eldebetam"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:180
msgid "Boruroom! Burarum!"
msgstr "Boruruum! Burarum!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:184
msgid "What?! The tree speaks!"
msgstr "Ne?! Ağaç konuşuyor!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:188
msgid ""
"I’ve heard tell of tree-folk... you must be a wose! Err, I’m terribly sorry "
"for the fireball. I couldn’t tell you apart from an ordinary oak."
msgstr ""
"Ağaç halkından söz edildiğini duymuştum... sen bir ulu ağaç olmalısın! Ee, "
"ateş topu için çok özür dilerim. Seni sıradan bir meşeden ayıramadım."

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:192
msgid "Burarum! Boom-toom-hun-rum-tum-ala-lola-ala?"
msgstr "Burarum! Bum-tum-hun-rum-tum-ala-lola-ala?"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:196
msgid ""
"A-rumgur-gurmum-un-rumba-ala-burarum! Burarum-ala-bortum-untum! A-rumgur-"
"gurmum-un-rumba-ala-boruroom! BURARUM!!"
msgstr ""
"A-rumgur-gurmum-un-rumba-ala-burarum! Burarum-ala-bortum-untum! "
"A-rumgur-gurmum-un-rumba-ala-boruruum! BURARUM!!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:200
msgid "It can’t understand me, and I can’t understand it... Oh no..."
msgstr "Beni anlayamıyor, ben de onu anlayamıyorum... Ah hayır..."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:216
msgid ""
"They’re preparing to attack! I’m not afraid of a few walking willows, but "
"burning down half the forest would hardly be the good first impression King "
"Garard tasked me with making."
msgstr ""
"Saldırmaya hazırlanıyorlar! Birkaç yürüyen söğütten korkmam, ama ormanın "
"yarısını yakmak Kral Garard’ın bırakmamı istediği iyi ilk izlenim pek olmaz."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:218
msgid ""
"I’m sure Methor would know what to do here. But I don’t. I think we have no "
"choice but to fight."
msgstr ""
"Eminim Methor burada ne yapacağını bilirdi. Ama ben bilmiyorum. Sanırım "
"savaşmaktan başka seçeneğimiz yok."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:226
msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgstr "Düşman liderini yen"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:230
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:446
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1040
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:399
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:609
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:665
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/09_Omaranth.cfg:183
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:497
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/12_The_Traitor.cfg:438
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/14_Long_Live_the_Queen.cfg:498
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/14_Long_Live_the_Queen.cfg:863
msgid "Death of Delfador"
msgstr "Delfador’un ölümü"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:252
msgid ""
"Woses have the <i>ambush</i> ability, making them invisible while in forest. "
"Any unit can temporarily reveal a wose by moving adjacent to it, but the "
"revealer will not be able to move afterwards — even if you have the "
"<i>skirmisher</i> ability. Ambushers will go back into hiding the moment you "
"move away (even if the ambusher hasn’t moved).\n"
"\n"
"Woses also have the powerful <i>regeneration</i> ability, and have high "
"resistance to several types of damage. <i><b>Make sure you recruit units "
"with effective damage types!</b></i> To see more details, right-click on a "
"wose and select <i>“Unit Type Description”.</i>"
msgstr ""
"Ulu ağaçların <i>pusu</i> yeteneği vardır; bu onları ormandayken görünmez "
"yapar. Herhangi bir birim yanına giderek bir ulu ağacı geçici olarak ortaya "
"çıkarabilir, ama ortaya çıkaran birim sonrasında hareket edemez — "
"<i>avcı</i> yeteneğin olsa bile. Pusucular sen uzaklaştığın anda (pusucu "
"hareket etmemiş olsa bile) yeniden saklanır.\n"
"\n"
"Ulu ağaçların ayrıca güçlü <i>yenilenme</i> yeteneği ve birkaç hasar türüne "
"karşı yüksek direnci vardır. <i><b>Etkili hasar türlerine sahip birimler "
"aldığından emin ol!</b></i> Daha fazla ayrıntı için bir ulu ağaca sağ "
"tıklayıp <i>“Birim Türü Açıklaması”</i>nı seç."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:266
msgid ""
"Where are those woses hiding? If I’m worried about my valuable veterans "
"getting ambushed, I could use new recruits as expendable pickets."
msgstr ""
"O ulu ağaçlar nerede saklanıyor? Değerli kıdemlilerimin pusuya düşmesinden "
"endişeleniyorsam yeni askerleri harcanabilir öncü nöbetçiler olarak "
"kullanabilirim."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:306
msgid "This hollow tree is full of bats!"
msgstr "Bu kovuk ağaç yarasalarla dolu!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:343
msgid "Ooohhhhoooom... Burarum..."
msgstr "Ooohhhhooom... Burarum..."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:359
msgid ""
"Halt!! Who are you, and why do you trouble the trees of the Grey Grove? "
"Speak, strangers, for the wrath of Wesnoth and the Lintanir elves is upon "
"you!"
msgstr ""
"Durun!! Kimsiniz ve Gri Koru’nun ağaçlarını neden rahatsız ediyorsunuz? "
"Konuşun yabancılar, çünkü Vesnot’un ve Lintanir elflerinin gazabı "
"üzerinizde!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:363
msgid ""
"Peace! Peace! You must be the man King Garard sent me to meet: Ambassador "
"Deoran."
msgstr ""
"Barış! Barış! Kral Garard’ın buluşmam için gönderdiği adam siz olmalısınız: "
"Elçi Deoran."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:371
msgid ""
"Please, can you speak with these woses and tell them we’re not their "
"enemies? This whole battle has been a terrible misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"Lütfen, bu ulu ağaçlarla konuşup onlara düşmanları olmadığımızı "
"söyleyebilir misiniz? Bütün bu savaş korkunç bir yanlış anlamaydı."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:375
msgid ""
"You’re a courier from Wesnoth? My apologies for the harsh words; long has it "
"been since Weldyn sent to this lonely post."
msgstr ""
"Vesnot’tan bir ulak mısın? Sert sözlerim için özür dilerim; Weldyn bu ıssız "
"karakola birini göndereli çok uzun zaman oldu."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:379
msgid ""
"But apology alone will not make right your transgressions against this rare "
"and precious wose-grove. If you really are who you claim to be, explain "
"yourself to me at once."
msgstr ""
"Ama yalnızca özür bu nadir ve değerli ulu ağaç korusuna karşı işlediğin "
"suçları düzeltmez. Gerçekten iddia ettiğin kişiysen kendini hemen açıkla."

#. [message]: speaker=leader2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:397
msgid ""
"Burarum! A-rumgur-gurmum-un-rumba-ala-burarum! Burarum-ala-bortum-untum! A-"
"rumgur-gurmum-un-rumba-ala-boruroom!"
msgstr ""
"Burarum! A-rumgur-gurmum-un-rumba-ala-burarum! Burarum-ala-bortum-untum! "
"A-rumgur-gurmum-un-rumba-ala-boruruum!"

#. [message]: role=young_wose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:407
msgid "Boom-toom-hun-rum-tum-ala-lola-ala! Burarum! Boruroom!"
msgstr "Bum-tum-hun-rum-tum-ala-lola-ala! Burarum! Boruruum!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/03_The_Ambassador.cfg:411
msgid ""
"There’s more of them than I realized! And they’re really angry now! Even if "
"I could fight my way through, the elves would never trust me after such a "
"show of force..."
msgstr ""
"Fark ettiğimden daha fazlalar! Ve artık gerçekten kızgınlar! Savaşarak yol "
"açabilsem bile böyle bir güç gösterisinden sonra elfler bana asla "
"güvenmez..."

#. [scenario]: id=04_The_Sylvan_Seer
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:11
msgid "The Sylvan Seer"
msgstr "Orman Kâhini"

#. [time]: id=dusk
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:16
msgid "Dusk"
msgstr "Alacakaranlık"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:24
msgid ""
"After a hasty explanation, and with Deoran’s aid, Delfador made many "
"apologies to the woses and their leader. Most of the destroyed trees had "
"fortunately not been killed, merely injured. Over the next several days, and "
"aided greatly by the woses’s natural regenerative abilities, Deoran showed "
"Delfador how to nurse the crippled tree-folk back to health."
msgstr ""
"Aceleyle yapılan bir açıklamadan sonra Deoran’ın yardımıyla Delfador ulu "
"ağaçlardan ve liderlerinden defalarca özür diledi. Neyse ki yok edilen "
"ağaçların çoğu ölmemiş, sadece yaralanmıştı. Sonraki birkaç gün boyunca, "
"ulu ağaçların doğal yenilenme yeteneklerinin de büyük yardımıyla, Deoran "
"Delfador’a sakat kalan ağaç halkını nasıl iyileştireceğini gösterdi."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:26
msgid ""
"At last, relations mended, the two of them set out to deliver King Garard’s "
"message to the elves..."
msgstr ""
"Sonunda ilişkiler düzelince ikisi Kral Garard’ın mesajını elflere iletmek "
"için yola çıktı..."

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:54
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:60
msgid "Lintanir"
msgstr "Lintanir"

#. [unit]: id=Eloreis
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:87
msgid "Eloreis"
msgstr "Eloreis"

#. [unit]: id=Parandra
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:100
msgid "Parandra"
msgstr "Parandra"

#. [unit]: id=Kalenz
#. [unit]: id=kalenz_mirror
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:111
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1321
msgid "Kalenz"
msgstr "Kalenz"

#. [unit]: id=Chantal
#. [unit]: id=chantal_mirror
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:123
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1338
msgid "Chantal"
msgstr "Şantal"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador is trying to speak, but gets interrupted by an elvish marshal
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:189
msgid "Okay, yes, but—"
msgstr "Tamam, evet, ama—"

#. [message]: speaker=Eloreis
#. Delfador has brought a message from King Garard to the elves, asking them to attack the whitefang orcs
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:194
msgid ""
"I understand Weldyn’s stance on orcs, but Garard cannot change the facts: "
"our rangers have neither the training nor the elfpower to fight an offensive "
"war on open ground! What your king asks of us is impossible."
msgstr ""
"Weldyn’in orklar konusundaki tutumunu anlıyorum, ama Garard gerçekleri "
"değiştiremez: korucularımızın açık arazide bir saldırı savaşı yürütecek ne "
"eğitimi ne de elf gücü var! Kralınızın bizden istediği imkânsız."

#. [message]: speaker=Parandra
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:198
msgid ""
"And why would we want to? The orcs stay out of our forests and we stay out "
"of their hills; this is the way things have been for over a century. Your "
"king promises us snow-covered mountains and barren desert as spoil, yet what "
"desire have we for more territory when Lintanir’s broad eaves could support "
"ten times our numbers?"
msgstr ""
"Hem neden isteyelim ki? Orklar ormanlarımızdan uzak durur, biz de onların "
"tepelerinden; yüz yılı aşkın bir süredir işler böyle. Kralınız bize ganimet "
"olarak karla kaplı dağlar ve çorak çöl vaat ediyor, ama Lintanir’in geniş "
"saçakları sayımızın on katını barındırabilirken daha fazla toprağa ne "
"arzumuz olabilir?"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:202
msgid ""
"My honorable lords and ladies, I understand your duty to safeguard your "
"lands and your people. And is that not what Weldyn does now? King Garard "
"must know the orcs threaten all peoples of Wesnoth, or why else would he "
"wage this war?"
msgstr ""
"Saygıdeğer beylerim ve hanımlarım, topraklarınızı ve halkınızı koruma "
"görevinizi anlıyorum. Weldyn’in şimdi yaptığı da bu değil mi? Kral Garard "
"orkların Vesnot’un bütün halklarını tehdit ettiğini bilmeli, yoksa bu "
"savaşı neden yürütsün?"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:207
msgid ""
"You are, of course, welcome to scorn my King’s call; to loiter in Lintanir; "
"to live and laugh and <i>linger</i>, until Wesnoth’s strength is spent "
"towards a pyrrhic victory or a bloody defeat.\n"
"\n"
"But know that I shall answer my King’s summons; I shall march to war. In "
"honor of the friendship we have built over my many years here, I would hope "
"Lintanir will as well."
msgstr ""
"Elbette Kralımın çağrısını küçümsemekte serbestsiniz; Lintanir’de "
"oyalanmakta; Vesnot’un gücü yıkıcı bir zafere ya da kanlı bir yenilgiye "
"harcanana kadar yaşayıp gülüp <i>oyalanmakta</i>.\n"
"\n"
"Ama bilin ki ben Kralımın çağrısına yanıt vereceğim; savaşa yürüyeceğim. "
"Burada geçirdiğim uzun yıllarda kurduğumuz dostluk adına, Lintanir’in de "
"yürümesini umarım."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:222
msgid "Truly, a moving speech..."
msgstr "Gerçekten de dokunaklı bir konuşma..."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:226
msgid ""
"Deoran, I am sorry, but Eloreis is right. This is not our fight. I have long-"
"before seen the horrors of a war between elves and orcs, and have no desire "
"to plunge my people back into such a nightmare."
msgstr ""
"Deoran, üzgünüm, ama Eloreis haklı. Bu bizim savaşımız değil. Elflerle "
"orklar arasındaki bir savaşın dehşetini çok uzun zaman önce gördüm ve "
"halkımı yeniden böyle bir kâbusa sürüklemeye hiç niyetim yok."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:230
msgid ""
"Should orcish hordes once again threaten the whole continent like they did "
"in times past, I would be the first to step up and offer my sword in service "
"of an alliance.\n"
"\n"
"But for territorial gain? I value your friendship and would honor the time "
"you have spent here, but if Wesnoth goes to war we cannot march alongside "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Ork orduları geçmiş zamanlarda olduğu gibi bir kez daha bütün kıtayı tehdit "
"ederse bir ittifakın hizmetine kılıcımı sunmak için ilk öne çıkan ben "
"olurum.\n"
"\n"
"Ama toprak kazancı için mi? Dostluğuna değer veriyorum ve burada geçirdiğin "
"zamana saygı duyuyorum, ama Vesnot savaşa giderse yanınızda yürüyemeyiz."

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#. 'Great-Grandfather' means Kalenz. Chantal is Kalenz's granddaughter
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:237
msgid ""
"Great-Grandfather, do not say such things! Deoran and his allies are risking "
"their lives in battle, and in all the vastness of Lintanir we can find "
"naught to offer but kind words? Force-of-arms is not the only strength of "
"the elves."
msgstr ""
"Büyük dedeciğim, böyle şeyler söyleme! Deoran ve müttefikleri savaşta "
"canlarını tehlikeye atıyor ve Lintanir’in bütün enginliğinde sunacak güzel "
"sözlerden başka bir şey bulamıyor muyuz? Silah gücü elflerin tek gücü değil."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:241
msgid ""
"Chantal, sometimes you remind me so much of your grandmother... perhaps you "
"are right. I have seen too many friends fall during my unnaturally long "
"life; sometimes to battle, sometimes to age. I would postpone that fate for "
"Deoran if I can, for both your sakes."
msgstr ""
"Şantal, bazen bana anneanneni o kadar çok hatırlatıyorsun ki... belki "
"haklısın. Doğal olmayan uzunluktaki ömrüm boyunca çok fazla dostun "
"düştüğünü gördüm; kimi savaşta, kimi yaşlılıktan. Elimden gelirse o kaderi "
"Deoran için ertelemek isterim; ikinizin de hatırı için."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:245
msgid ""
"Deoran, Delfador, what I now speak to you concerns one of our great secrets; "
"you are not to speak of this to anyone, even to your king."
msgstr ""
"Deoran, Delfador, size şimdi söyleyeceklerim büyük sırlarımızdan biriyle "
"ilgili; bunu kimseye, kralınıza bile söylememelisiniz."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:250
msgid ""
"Deep within Lintanir resides our sylph — an elven seer. We both favor and "
"fear Elende’s fractured, arcane sight; her strands of reflected prophecy. "
"Perhaps her visions may illuminate some measure of your futures, and in "
"doing so help you blaze brighter ones."
msgstr ""
"Lintanir’in derinliklerinde silfimiz — bir elf kâhini — yaşar. Elende’nin "
"parçalı, gizemli görüşünü; yansıyan kehanet ipliklerini hem severiz hem de "
"ondan korkarız. Belki görüleri geleceklerinizin bir kısmını aydınlatabilir "
"ve böylece daha parlak gelecekler açmanıza yardım edebilir."

#. [message]: speaker=Eloreis
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:254
msgid ""
"Kalenz, are you sure this is wise? Seers are known to be... esoteric... and "
"Elende has been particularly cloistered these last few decades."
msgstr ""
"Kalenz, bunun akıllıca olduğundan emin misin? Kâhinlerin... anlaşılmaz "
"olduğu bilinir... ve Elende son birkaç on yıldır özellikle inzivada."

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:258
msgid ""
"I shall accompany them. I wish to spend some time with with these humans "
"before they depart."
msgstr ""
"Ben de onlara eşlik edeceğim. Bu insanlar ayrılmadan önce onlarla biraz "
"vakit geçirmek istiyorum."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:262
msgid "And so do and so shall I. Come, follow me."
msgstr "Öyle olsun, ben de geleceğim. Gelin, beni takip edin."

#. [time]: id=midnight
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:283
msgid "Midnight"
msgstr "Gece Yarısı"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:294
msgid ""
"There’s 5 gold pieces in this old boat! I suppose it’s better than nothing."
msgstr "Bu eski teknede 5 altın var! Sanırım hiç yoktan iyidir."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. said after a Forest Lion, Horned Scarab, or Silverback (a gorilla) attacks one of the player's units
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:375
msgid "Look out! There’re beasts in the forest!"
msgstr "Dikkat! Ormanda hayvanlar var!"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#. said after the player double-clicks on Delfador to try and cast a spell
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:390
msgid ""
"No magic more unusual than a fireball, Delfador. We don’t want to appear "
"threatening."
msgstr ""
"Ateş topundan daha alışılmadık bir büyü yok, Delfador. Tehditkâr görünmek "
"istemeyiz."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:411
msgid ""
"Kalenz leads Delfador, Deoran, and Chantal down a labyrinthine path through "
"the deep wood, past twists and turns and over winding tracks.\n"
"\n"
"In many places there is no path at all, and Delfador senses they are guided "
"more by the elves’ connection to the faerie than by conventional pathfinding."
msgstr ""
"Kalenz, Delfador’u, Deoran’ı ve Şantal’ı derin ormanın içinden, dönemeçler "
"ve kıvrımlar boyunca, dolambaçlı patikaların üzerinden labirent gibi bir "
"yoldan götürüyor.\n"
"\n"
"Pek çok yerde hiç patika yok ve Delfador, olağan yol bulmaktan çok elflerin "
"peri âlemiyle bağıyla yönlendirildiklerini seziyor."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:417
msgid ""
"The sun sets like a dying ember quenched beneath the horizon, and the forest "
"grows dim. Several times even Kalenz becomes lost, but each time manages to "
"find the way again. At last, in the dead of night, a small structure looms "
"out of the forest..."
msgstr ""
"Güneş ufkun altında sönen ölmekte olan bir kor gibi batıyor ve orman "
"kararıyor. Birkaç kez Kalenz bile kayboluyor, ama her seferinde yolu "
"yeniden bulmayı başarıyor. Sonunda gecenin ortasında ormanın içinden küçük "
"bir yapı beliriyor..."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:427
msgid ""
"We have arrived. The seer’s mirror pool is just ahead; she herself should be "
"close by."
msgstr ""
"Vardık. Kâhinin ayna havuzu hemen ileride; kendisi de yakınlarda olmalı."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:435
msgid "Find the Sylph"
msgstr "Silf’i bul"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:439
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:475
msgid "Death of Delfador, Deoran, Chantal, or Kalenz"
msgstr "Delfador’un, Deoran’ın, Şantal’ın ya da Kalenz’in ölümü"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:447
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:483
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1415
msgid "Kalenz and Chantal will not follow you to the next scenario."
msgstr "Kalenz ve Şantal seni sonraki senaryoya takip etmeyecek."

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:450
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/10_Houses_of_the_Dead.cfg:158
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/10_Houses_of_the_Dead.cfg:363
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/10_Houses_of_the_Dead.cfg:802
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/10_Houses_of_the_Dead.cfg:1146
msgid "In this scenario, you can neither gain nor spend gold."
msgstr "Bu senaryoda altın ne kazanabilir ne de harcayabilirsin."

#. [message]
#. there is a pool of water in the middle of the map. Right now the pool is mostly dry - your objective is to solve a puzzle to fill the pool with water
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:466
msgid "There lies the mirror pool, but it is strangely dry..."
msgstr "İşte ayna havuzu, ama tuhaf şekilde kuru..."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:471
msgid "Fill the central pool with water"
msgstr "Ortadaki havuzu suyla doldur"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:486
msgid ""
"Villages do not provide income in this scenario (since you have unlimited "
"turns), but still provide healing."
msgstr ""
"Bu senaryoda köyler gelir sağlamaz (sınırsız elin olduğu için), ama yine de "
"iyileştirir."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:512
msgid ""
"This is a puzzle segment. If you don’t like puzzles or find it too "
"challenging, you can choose to skip it."
msgstr ""
"Bu bir bulmaca bölümü. Bulmacalardan hoşlanmıyorsan ya da çok zor "
"buluyorsan atlamayı seçebilirsin."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:514
msgid ""
"The puzzle is harder on high difficulties, and much easier on low "
"difficulties."
msgstr "Bulmaca yüksek zorluklarda daha zor, düşük zorluklarda çok daha kolay."

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:516
msgid "Play the puzzle <i>(includes XP)</i>"
msgstr "Bulmacayı oyna <i>(TP dahil)</i>"

#. [option]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:519
msgid "Skip the puzzle"
msgstr "Bulmacayı atla"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. referencing the events in The South Guard; exaggerated
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:552
msgid ""
"Deoran, I took an exam on you during my second year at Alduin. Is it true "
"you single-handedly beat down a horde of black-magic bandits and saved the "
"south from destruction? You’re practically a folk hero!"
msgstr ""
"Deoran, Alduin’deki ikinci yılımda senin hakkında bir sınava girdim. Bir "
"kara büyücü haydut sürüsünü tek başına yenip güneyi yıkımdan kurtardığın "
"doğru mu? Neredeyse bir halk kahramanısın!"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#. this is what has happened to Deoran since ending The South Guard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:557
msgid ""
"To some, perhaps. The king was less pleased — Garard is magnanimous towards "
"his favorites, but has little tolerance for failure. I found scant room for "
"advancement within Wesnoth after so much blood spilled in Westin."
msgstr ""
"Bazılarına göre belki. Kral o kadar memnun değildi — Garard gözdelerine "
"karşı cömerttir, ama başarısızlığa pek tahammülü yoktur. Vestin’de o kadar "
"kan döküldükten sonra Vesnot içinde yükselmek için pek yer bulamadım."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:561
msgid ""
"But that all happened many years ago. Ambassador to Lintanir is a "
"prestigious position, in name if nothing else, and an opportunity to "
"exercise what I learned from my time amongst the Aethenwood elves. I have "
"come to value my friends here."
msgstr ""
"Ama bunların hepsi yıllar önce oldu. Lintanir elçiliği, adından başka bir "
"şey değilse bile saygın bir görev ve Eten elfleri arasında geçirdiğim "
"zamanda öğrendiklerimi uygulama fırsatı. Buradaki dostlarıma değer vermeye "
"başladım."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:565
msgid ""
"I must confess I look forward to once again marching in company with others "
"of my own ilk, yet still I hope to return to Lintanir once my war-duty is "
"done."
msgstr ""
"Kendi soyumdan olanlarla bir kez daha birlikte yürümeyi dört gözle "
"beklediğimi itiraf etmeliyim, ama yine de savaş görevim bitince Lintanir’e "
"dönmeyi umuyorum."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:579
msgid ""
"Chantal, we have much to speak about. It is clear you have feelings for the "
"ambassador. Deoran is no fool; if he does not already know, he certainly "
"suspects."
msgstr ""
"Şantal, konuşacak çok şeyimiz var. Elçiye karşı hislerin olduğu açık. "
"Deoran aptal değil; henüz bilmiyorsa bile kesinlikle şüpheleniyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:583
msgid ""
"—who? What? Great-Grandfather, I have no idea what you’re talking about."
msgstr ""
"—kim? Ne? Büyük dedeciğim, neden bahsettiğin hakkında hiçbir fikrim yok."

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#. continuing the "Chantal has feelings for Deoran" conversation, a moment after it ended
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:590
msgid ""
"Okay— fine, yes, but Deoran is a good man! Wise and kind, and quietly "
"bearing his burden of exile, so far away from his people? And he’s <i>human</"
"i>! Even a crusty old elf like you has to admit that round ears and stubble "
"are exotic."
msgstr ""
"Tamam— peki, evet, ama Deoran iyi bir adam! Bilge ve nazik; halkından bu "
"kadar uzakta sürgünün yükünü sessizce taşıyor, değil mi? Hem o bir "
"<i>insan</i>! Senin gibi huysuz yaşlı bir elf bile yuvarlak kulakların ve "
"sakal uzamış yüzün egzotik olduğunu kabul etmeli."

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:594
msgid ""
"The lives of men burn brightly, but briefly. Even if he returns to Lintanir, "
"what future could you build together? I will not stop you if you want to "
"pursue this, but I know all-too-well the pain from outliving those you love. "
"Cleodil was just as stubborn as you..."
msgstr ""
"İnsanların hayatları parlak ama kısa yanar. Lintanir’e dönse bile birlikte "
"nasıl bir gelecek kurabilirsiniz? Bunun peşinden gitmek istersen seni "
"durdurmam, ama sevdiklerinden daha uzun yaşamanın acısını çok iyi bilirim. "
"Kleodil de senin kadar inatçıydı..."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. the player has just moved a unit onto one of several blue orbs scattered around the map, which has caused a river to change direction. This is part of the puzzle
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:607
msgid "Look, the stream is changing direction!"
msgstr "Bakın, dere yön değiştiriyor!"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:611
msgid "Moonstones! Elende, what have you been up to..."
msgstr "Ay taşları! Elende, neler yapıyorsun sen..."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. a monster has just drowned in the river, as a result of the player redirecting the river into the beast's hex
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:619
msgid "Odd, the water appears shallow but the beast has vanished entirely."
msgstr "Tuhaf, su sığ görünüyor ama hayvan tamamen kayboldu."

#. [message]
#. a player unit has just drowned in the river, as a result of the player redirecting the river into the beast's hex
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:652
msgid ""
"This sandbed is shallow, but the water is suddenly deep and a strange magic "
"tugs at my legs! I am drowning!"
msgstr ""
"Bu kum yatağı sığ, ama su birden derinleşti ve tuhaf bir büyü bacaklarımı "
"çekiyor! Boğuluyorum!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:653
msgid ""
"female^This sandbed is shallow, but the water is suddenly deep and a strange "
"magic tugs at my legs! I am drowning!"
msgstr ""
"Bu kum yatağı sığ, ama su birden derinleşti ve tuhaf bir büyü bacaklarımı "
"çekiyor! Boğuluyorum!"

#. [message]
#. a monster has just drowned in the river, as a result of the player redirecting the river into the beast's hex
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:664
msgid "Gurgle gurgle gurgle..."
msgstr "Gulu gulu gulu..."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. the player has completed their puzzle, and filled the central "mirror pool" with water
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1082
msgid "There! The pool is full!"
msgstr "İşte! Havuz doldu!"

#. [time]: id=void
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1109
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/14_Long_Live_the_Queen.cfg:704
msgid "Void"
msgstr "Boşluk"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1148
msgid "What was that?!"
msgstr "O neydi?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1159
msgid ""
"I think this whole mirror world is starting to fall apart! I have to hurry!"
msgstr "Sanırım bütün bu ayna dünyası dağılmaya başlıyor! Acele etmeliyim!"

#. [message]
#. the player's units have just been transported into a strange realm, and aren't sure what's going on. Kalenz probably knows more than anybody else, and is calling out to see where Elende is (and what exactly she's doing)
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1303
msgid "Elende!"
msgstr "Elende!"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1308
msgid "Elende, I come with friends, seeking foresight! Deoran and Del—"
msgstr "Elende, dostlarla geldim, öngörü arıyoruz! Deoran ve Del—"

#. [message]
#. immediately after this, magically created "mirror image" units of younger/older versions of Kalenz, Chantal, and Deoran appear
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1314
msgid ""
"I know who you are, Delfador of Alduin. But how well do you know yourselves?"
msgstr ""
"Kim olduğunu biliyorum, Alduinli Delfador. Ama kendinizi ne kadar iyi "
"tanıyorsunuz?"

#. [unit]: id=deoran_mirror
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1355
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/utils/unified_characters.cfg:78
msgid "Deoran"
msgstr "Deoran"

#. [message]
#. referencing the mirror image of Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1371
msgid "Deoran, is that... you? You look so much younger."
msgstr "Deoran, bu... sen misin? Çok daha genç görünüyorsun."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1375
msgid "What’s going on?! Kalenz, is this normal?"
msgstr "Neler oluyor?! Kalenz, bu normal mi?"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1401
msgid "Defeat all enemies"
msgstr "Bütün düşmanları yen"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#. if reduced to 0 hp, Delfador doesn't die. Instead, he's kicked out of the mirror world, and fails the scenario
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1406
msgid "Loss of Delfador"
msgstr "Delfador’un kaybı"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1418
msgid ""
"In this strange world, fate guides every strike. <i>(attacks never miss)</i>"
msgstr ""
"Bu tuhaf dünyada kader her darbeye yön verir. <i>(saldırılar asla "
"ıskalamaz)</i>"

#. [event]: id=always_hit
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1444
msgid ""
"The mortal world beckons; tell me the rest of the prophecy when next we meet!"
msgstr ""
"Ölümlü dünya çağırıyor; bir dahaki karşılaşmamızda kehanetin geri kalanını "
"anlat!"

#. [event]: id=always_hit
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1445
msgid "Elende, I hope you know what you’re doing. Good luck, the rest of you!"
msgstr "Elende, umarım ne yaptığını biliyorsundur. Geri kalanınıza iyi şanslar!"

#. [event]: id=always_hit
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1446
msgid ""
"Owww! Elende, it’s very rude to banish someone without their permission!"
msgstr "Ahh! Elende, birini izni olmadan sürgün etmek çok kabalık!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador has just been reduced to 0hp, and been "kicked out" of Elenede's "mirror realm" or wherever she was giving the prophecy
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1454
msgid "Hey, stop—"
msgstr "Hey, dur—"

#. [time]: id=dawn
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1472
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1988
msgid "Dawn"
msgstr "Şafak"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador has missed the ending of the prophecy, and the player loses the scenario
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1497
msgid "I didn’t get to finish hearing everything..."
msgstr "Her şeyi dinlemeyi bitiremedim..."

#. [message]
#. spoken by Elende (through Kalenz's mirror image), referencing Legend of Wesmere's invisibility potion and Landar
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1527
msgid ""
"Lich’s eye and brother’s bone; what have you sacrificed to save your people, "
"Kalenz? Your greatest fear stands before you... ahead of you?"
msgstr ""
"Umacının gözü ve kardeşin kemiği; halkını kurtarmak için neleri feda ettin, "
"Kalenz? En büyük korkun önünde duruyor... ileride mi?"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1531
msgid "That was long ago, Elende! This is about the humans’ story, not mine."
msgstr ""
"O çok uzun zaman önceydi, Elende! Bu benim değil, insanların hikâyesiyle "
"ilgili."

#. [message]
#. spoken by Elende (through Deoran's mirror image), referencing his exile. I intend "nation" more in the "people" sense than the "country" sense.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1568
msgid ""
"Deoran the exile returns home; returns to a nation that scorned him, ignored "
"his counsel and cast him away. What will become of the life he has built "
"amongst Lintanir’s twilight eaves?"
msgstr ""
"Sürgün Deoran yurduna dönüyor; onu küçümseyen, öğütlerini görmezden gelen "
"ve onu bir kenara atan bir ulusa dönüyor. Lintanir’in alacakaranlık "
"saçakları altında kurduğu hayatın ne olacak?"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1572
msgid ""
"I know my duty! A captain of Wesnoth will never entertain doubts of loyalty, "
"whether to his country or his King."
msgstr ""
"Görevimi biliyorum! Vesnot’un bir yüzbaşısı, ister ülkesine ister Kralına "
"olsun, sadakati konusunda asla şüpheye kapılmaz."

#. [message]
#. spoken by Elende (through Chantal's mirror image), referencing Cleodil's historic death and foreshadowing Deoran's upcoming death
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1585
msgid "Chantal—"
msgstr "Şantal—"

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1589
msgid ""
"I already know what you’re going to say Elende! Don’t you dare; I will when "
"I’m ready."
msgstr ""
"Ne diyeceğini zaten biliyorum, Elende! Sakın ha; hazır olduğumda yapacağım."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1595
msgid ""
"Then you may soon understand some measure of your great-grandfather’s bygone "
"sorrows..."
msgstr ""
"O zaman büyük dedenin geçmişteki kederlerinin bir kısmını yakında "
"anlayabilirsin..."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1674
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1925
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1932
msgid "Elende"
msgstr "Elende"

#. [message]
#. Elende reaveals that she's the one who gave the weird prophecy thing to Delfador at Alduin, even though she wasn't physically there
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1677
msgid ""
"And what of the fire mage? Young but ambitious, brilliant yet foolish. It "
"has been many moons since I spoke to you at Alduin."
msgstr ""
"Peki ya ateş büyücüsü? Genç ama hırslı, parlak ama aptal. Seninle Alduin’de "
"konuşalı çok ay oldu."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1681
msgid ""
"That was you, back at graduation? I knew I heard a voice! Master Leollyn "
"thought I was going crazy..."
msgstr ""
"Mezuniyette sen miydin? Bir ses duyduğumu biliyordum! Usta Leollin "
"deliriyorum sanmıştı..."

#. [event]
#. [event]: type=Delfador L4, id=delfador_mirror4
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1686
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1823
msgid ""
"Spend 4 XP to gain flight and the skirmisher ability until the start of your "
"next turn or until cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Bir sonraki elinin başına kadar ya da iptal edilene kadar uçuş ve avcı "
"yeteneği kazanmak için 4 TP harca."

#. [message]
#. pale spy meaning Asheviere. Referencing Asheviere resolving to kill Garard, and working with orcs to arrange the events of the next two scenarios
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1716
msgid ""
"I see secrets in the dark; a pale spy slips their bonds. A death, a "
"deceiver. Ringed swords, cold blood, false friends."
msgstr ""
"Karanlıkta sırlar görüyorum; solgun bir casus bağlarından sıyrılıyor. Bir "
"ölüm, bir aldatıcı. Halka kılıçlar, soğuk kan, sahte dostlar."

#. [message]
#. referencing Delfador's adventures in scenarios 8-10, where he works with (or kills) poachers to fight saurians, then fights undead and a ghost given the appearance of a living drake.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1778
msgid ""
"The dark swamp looms. Purses and poachers, mirror and smoke. A figure of "
"shadow cloaked in the spirits of the dead. Battles won while wars are lost."
msgstr ""
"Kara bataklık beliriyor. Keseler ve kaçak avcılar, ayna ve duman. Ölülerin "
"ruhlarına bürünmüş bir gölge figürü. Savaşlar kaybedilirken kazanılan "
"muharebeler."

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1785
msgid ""
"Spend 16 XP to disallow magical attacks in a 3-hex radius, until cancelled."
msgstr ""
"İptal edilene kadar 3 altıgen yarıçapında büyülü saldırıları engellemek "
"için 16 TP harca."

#. [message]
#. referencing the civil war when Asheviere takes power
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1810
msgid ""
"Brother against brother, father against child. From the barren throne will "
"rise an angel of ashes; both great and terrible alike. The delicate balance "
"of mankind will be broken, and flames shall blaze anew across the embers of "
"Haldric’s people."
msgstr ""
"Kardeş kardeşe, baba evlada karşı. Çorak tahttan küllerden bir melek "
"yükselecek; hem yüce hem korkunç. İnsanlığın narin dengesi bozulacak ve "
"alevler Haldrik’in halkının korları üzerinde yeniden parlayacak."

#. [event]: type=Delfador L4, id=delfador_mirror4
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1821
msgid ""
"Spend 48 XP to grant yourself and all allies double movement and a second "
"attack this turn. When this turn ends, affected units become slowed."
msgstr ""
"Bu el kendine ve bütün müttefiklerine çift hareket ve ikinci bir saldırı "
"vermek için 48 TP harca. Bu el bittiğinde etkilenen birimler yavaşlatılmış "
"olur."

#. [message]
#. referncing the future events of HttT; Konrad and Li'Sar retriving the sceptre of fire
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1914
msgid ""
"Black soot rains over Weldyn. The line of kings sundered; the ruby of the "
"wesfolk restored. The nameless son and the ashen daughter."
msgstr ""
"Weldyn’e kara is yağıyor. Krallar soyu kopmuş; batı halkının yakutu geri "
"verilmiş. İsimsiz oğul ve kül rengi kız."

#. [message]
#. referencing Delfador's choice in S10x
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1928
msgid ""
"But this fate is not the only path. Mage of Alduin, you stand at a knot in "
"the strands, a nexus of the shards. For one brief moment, you will possess "
"the power to alter the currents of time; to rewrite the future that is "
"written."
msgstr ""
"Ama bu kader tek yol değil. Alduin büyücüsü, ipliklerin bir düğümünde, "
"parçaların bir kesişiminde duruyorsun. Kısa bir an için zamanın "
"akıntılarını değiştirme, yazılmış geleceği yeniden yazma gücüne sahip "
"olacaksın."

#. [message]
#. referencing Delfador's choice in S10x. He can either listen to a drunk Garard and kill Garard's brother Arand based on false reports of a betrayal, or refuse, stay with Garard, and find out more about Arand before attacking
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1935
msgid ""
"When that moment comes, remember... endeavor to bestow not destruction with "
"that fire that you possess, but the gleaming light of truth instead. Quench "
"the flames of fear before all your world is consumed."
msgstr ""
"O an geldiğinde hatırla... sahip olduğun o ateşle yıkım değil, onun yerine "
"gerçeğin parıldayan ışığını bahşetmeye çalış. Bütün dünyan yanıp kül "
"olmadan korkunun alevlerini söndür."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:1939
msgid "But, what? I don’t understa—"
msgstr "Ama, ne? Anlam—"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador previously said "But, what? I don’t understa—", but has now been kicked out of Elende's 'mirror world' and is back in the normal world. The scenario is over.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/04_The_Sylvan_Seer.cfg:2011
msgid "—nd what you’re saying..."
msgstr "—ıyorum ne dediğini..."

#. [scenario]: id=05_The_Deceiver
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:11
msgid "The Deceiver"
msgstr "Aldatıcı"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Delfador and his companions departed the mirror grove in hushed silence. The "
"Sylph’s words weighed heavily on each of their minds."
msgstr ""
"Delfador ve yoldaşları ayna korusundan derin bir sessizlik içinde ayrıldı. "
"Silf’in sözleri her birinin zihnine ağır geliyordu."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:24
msgid ""
"After lengthy deliberation, and much to Chantal’s displeasure, Delfador and "
"Deoran resolved to continue on with their mission. Exiting the forest after "
"several days’ westward travel, they soon sighted the banners of the king’s "
"army."
msgstr ""
"Uzun bir müzakereden sonra, Şantal’ı çok üzecek şekilde, Delfador ve Deoran "
"görevlerine devam etmeye karar verdi. Birkaç günlük batı yolculuğundan "
"sonra ormandan çıkınca çok geçmeden kralın ordusunun sancaklarını gördüler."

#. [side]: type=Orcish Crossbowman, id=Shogro
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:54
msgid "Shogro"
msgstr "Şogro"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Khovak
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:72
msgid "Khovak"
msgstr "Hovak"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:302
msgid "90 gold"
msgstr "90 altın"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:302
msgid "These orcs were sitting on some gold! We can put it to better use."
msgstr ""
"Bu orklar biraz altının üzerinde oturuyormuş! Onu daha iyi kullanabiliriz."

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:316
msgid "Captain Kestrel"
msgstr "Yüzbaşı Kestrel"

#. [message]: speaker=Chantal
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:365
msgid ""
"Deoran, are you sure you won’t reconsider staying in the Lintanir? What "
"Elende said..."
msgstr ""
"Deoran, Lintanir’de kalmayı yeniden düşünmeyeceğinden emin misin? "
"Elende’nin söyledikleri..."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:369
msgid ""
"My duty comes first, always. Would you truly want me any other way, Chantal?"
msgstr ""
"Görevim her zaman önce gelir. Beni gerçekten başka türlü ister miydin, "
"Şantal?"

#. [message]: speaker=Kalenz
#. referencing the beginning of HttT, where Delfador and Konrad are staying with the elves
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:375
msgid ""
"Deoran, it has been a pleasure to have you with us these years. And "
"Delfador, I hope to someday say the same of you as well. Elende seems to "
"think highly of you, and that means a great deal to me and my people.\n"
"\n"
"Should either of you ever find yourselves searching for a home away from "
"Wesnoth, you will always be welcome with us."
msgstr ""
"Deoran, bu yıllarda bizimle olman bir zevkti. Ve Delfador, umarım bir gün "
"senin için de aynısını söyleyebilirim. Elende senin hakkında yüksek "
"düşünüyor gibi ve bu benim ve halkım için çok şey ifade ediyor.\n"
"\n"
"İkinizden biri Vesnot’tan uzakta bir yurt aradığında, bizim yanımızda her "
"zaman hoş karşılanacaksınız."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:391
msgid ""
"Hail! The fledgling war-mage returns. Welcome, Delfador... and Deoran. Tell "
"me, are the north-elves with us?"
msgstr ""
"Selam! Toy savaş büyücüsü dönüyor. Hoş geldin Delfador... ve Deoran. "
"Söyleyin, kuzey elfleri bizimle mi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:395
msgid "Deepest apologies my Lord, but they are not. Lintanir—"
msgstr "Derin özürlerimi sunarım Efendim, ama değiller. Lintanir—"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:399
msgid ""
"I see. Unfortunate, but ultimately of no consequence. Victory is nearly won "
"even without their aid."
msgstr ""
"Anlıyorum. Talihsiz, ama sonuçta önemsiz. Onların yardımı olmadan da zafer "
"neredeyse kazanıldı."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:404
msgid ""
"See there: we’ve driven the Whitefang chieftain and the last of his guards "
"into this old hill fort."
msgstr "Bakın: Akdiş reisini ve son muhafızlarını bu eski tepe kalesine sürdük."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:408
msgid ""
"The timing of your return couldn’t have been better, Delfador. General "
"Lionel and my brother Arand will press them from the front, while you sneak "
"in the back and roast their chief like a pig on a spit."
msgstr ""
"Dönüşünün zamanlaması bundan daha iyi olamazdı, Delfador. General Lionel ve "
"kardeşim Arand onları önden sıkıştırırken sen arkadan sızıp reislerini "
"şişteki domuz gibi kızartacaksın."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:412
msgid ""
"Without their chief the Whitefangs will dissolve into an infighting mass of "
"petty squabbles, and our— Wesnoth’s victory will be complete!"
msgstr ""
"Reisleri olmadan Akdişler adi kavgalarla birbirine giren bir kalabalığa "
"dönüşecek ve bizim— Vesnot’un zaferi tamamlanacak!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:420
msgid "Defeat Khovak, the orcish warlord"
msgstr "Ork savaş beyi Hovak’ı yen"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:424
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:583
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:504
msgid "Death of Delfador or Deoran"
msgstr "Delfador’un ya da Deoran’ın ölümü"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:428
msgid "Death of Garard, Arand, Lionel, or Methor"
msgstr "Garard’ın, Arand’ın, Lionel’in ya da Methor’un ölümü"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:448
msgid ""
"Don’t rush the assault, Lionel — no need to waste good men. Take some time "
"to stage our forces outside their walls, then attack just before the second "
"dawn."
msgstr ""
"Saldırıda acele etme Lionel — iyi adamları harcamaya gerek yok. Güçlerimizi "
"surlarının dışında düzene sokmak için biraz zaman ayır, sonra ikinci "
"şafaktan hemen önce saldır."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:452
msgid ""
"We have them right where we want them. Once our forces are assembled, I "
"shall join the battle personally and savor this victory up close."
msgstr ""
"Onları tam istediğimiz yerde tuttuk. Güçlerimiz toplandığında savaşa bizzat "
"katılıp bu zaferin tadını yakından çıkaracağım."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:456
msgid ""
"I’m surprised the Whitefangs have been driven to the brink of defeat so "
"quickly. Chantal speaks of them as numerous and cunning... I wonder if "
"something is amiss."
msgstr ""
"Akdişlerin bu kadar çabuk yenilginin eşiğine sürülmesine şaşırdım. Şantal "
"onlardan kalabalık ve kurnaz diye söz ediyor... acaba bir terslik mi var."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:468
msgid ""
"An orcish shaman! On occasion I’ve known some of the other clans to use "
"their apprentices as warriors, but Clan Whitefang usually keeps theirs far "
"from the frontline."
msgstr ""
"Bir ork şamanı! Bazen diğer klanların çıraklarını savaşçı olarak "
"kullandığını bilirim, ama Akdiş Klanı genellikle kendininkileri ön cepheden "
"uzak tutar."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:472
msgid ""
"What unusual magic! I don’t think I can tap into whatever fundamental forces "
"she was using, but now that I have her equipment I’ll bet I could figure out "
"how to imitate that draining attack... for our next battle, at least."
msgstr ""
"Ne alışılmadık bir büyü! Kullandığı temel güçlere erişebileceğimi "
"sanmıyorum, ama artık teçhizatı bende olduğuna göre o emici saldırıyı nasıl "
"taklit edeceğimi çözebilirim... en azından bir sonraki savaşımız için."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:498
msgid ""
"I have still not recruited or recalled any soldiers! That orcish shaman we "
"defeated was standing on a keep. We should seize it and recruit our army "
"before we attack the orcs’ main camp."
msgstr ""
"Hâlâ hiç asker almadım ya da geri çağırmadım! Yendiğimiz o ork şamanı bir "
"burçta duruyordu. Orkların ana kampına saldırmadan önce orayı ele geçirip "
"ordumuzu almalıyız."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:522
msgid "There’s more of them coming from the north! Should we go attack?"
msgstr "Kuzeyden daha fazlası geliyor! Saldırmaya gidelim mi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Khovak
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:526
msgid "Stay in our fort, worm! Stick to the plan."
msgstr "Kalemizde kal, kurtçuk! Plana sadık kal."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. "trog" is a made-up slur referring to an orc
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:539
msgid ""
"You’re squatting in my summer home, trogs! No more raids for you; no more "
"pillage and plunder. Last chance to surrender!"
msgstr ""
"Yazlık evime çökmüşsünüz, mağara adamları! Artık baskın yok; artık yağma ve "
"talan yok. Teslim olmak için son şans!"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:543
msgid "Up yours, pink-skin!"
msgstr "Al sana, pembe deri!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador is telling his master Methor about the adventures he had in the last 2 scenarios
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:568
msgid ""
"Hello there, master, it’s nice to see you again! You’ll never believe the "
"adventures I’ve had. Did you know there’s an elvish prophecy about me?!"
msgstr ""
"Merhaba usta, sizi yeniden görmek güzel! Yaşadığım maceralara "
"inanamayacaksınız. Benim hakkımda bir elf kehaneti olduğunu biliyor "
"muydunuz?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:572
msgid ""
"(smiling) Delfador, don’t make me regret teaching you that psychedelic "
"spell! I’m just glad you’ve made it back safe and sound."
msgstr ""
"(gülümseyerek) Delfador, sana o sanrı büyüsünü öğrettiğime pişman etme "
"beni! Sağ salim döndüğüne sevindim sadece."

#. [message]: speaker=Shogro
#. the whitefangs orcs are luring Garard into overextending. Shogro is bait, and has just died
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:586
msgid "Stinking Ushka’e! This was a terrible plan..."
msgstr "Kokuşmuş Uşka’e! Bu berbat bir plandı..."

#. [message]: speaker=Khovak
#. the whitefangs orcs are luring Garard into overextending. Khovak is bait, and has just died
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:611
msgid "Human dogs! You’ve just sealed your deaths..."
msgstr "İnsan köpekleri! Kendi ölümünüzü mühürlediniz..."

#. [message]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:628
msgid "Run for the hills!"
msgstr "Tepelere kaçın!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:643
msgid "Yes! Did I do well, Your Majesty?"
msgstr "Evet! İyi iş çıkardım mı, Majesteleri?"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. Garard thinks he's won, even though he hasn't
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:648
msgid "Indeed you did. Fantastic battle, everyone, the orcs are broken!"
msgstr ""
"Gerçekten de çıkardın. Harika bir savaştı millet, orklar bozguna uğradı!"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:656
msgid ""
"Footmen — down into the fort’s dungeons! Flush out any stragglers and "
"complete our victory."
msgstr ""
"Piyadeler — kalenin zindanlarına inin! Geride kalanları temizleyin ve "
"zaferimizi tamamlayın."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. Garard thinks he's won, even though he hasn't. "Wold" means "a piece of high, open, uncultivated land or moor."
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:700
msgid ""
"Hah! I think “Garard’s Wold” will make a good name for the new province... "
"or perhaps “Garard’s Triumph”? What do you think, Lionel?"
msgstr ""
"Hah! Sanırım “Garard’ın Yaylası” yeni eyalet için iyi bir ad olur... ya da "
"belki “Garard’ın Zaferi”? Ne dersin, Lionel?"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:705
msgid ""
"Delfador, something’s wrong. The orc leader we killed... isn’t the Whitefang "
"chief."
msgstr ""
"Delfador, bir şeyler yanlış. Öldürdüğümüz ork lideri... Akdiş reisi değil."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:709
msgid "What? How can you tell?"
msgstr "Ne? Nereden anlıyorsun?"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:713
msgid ""
"I met Clan Whitefang’s leaders around a year ago, when Lintanir negotiated a "
"treaty. This orc’s face is narrower than I remember, and his helmet doesn’t "
"have the right war-paint. Delfador, I think we’ve been tricked!"
msgstr ""
"Akdiş Klanı’nın liderleriyle yaklaşık bir yıl önce, Lintanir bir antlaşma "
"için müzakere ederken tanıştım. Bu orkun yüzü hatırladığımdan daha dar ve "
"miğferinde doğru savaş boyası yok. Delfador, sanırım kandırıldık!"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/05_The_Deceiver.cfg:760
msgid ""
"Are you even trying to fight, Delfador!? I should have known a mage would "
"never have the stomach for true battle; get back to Alduin where you belong!"
msgstr ""
"Savaşmaya çalışıyor musun bari, Delfador!? Bir büyücünün gerçek savaşa asla "
"midesinin kaldırmayacağını bilmeliydim; ait olduğun Alduin’e dön!"

#. [scenario]: id=06_Ring_of_Swords
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:6
msgid "Ring of Swords"
msgstr "Kılıçlar Halkası"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Warlord, id=Ghazgir
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:49
msgid "Ghazgir"
msgstr "Gazgir"

#. [side]: type=Direwolf Rider, id=Mukhu
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:68
msgid "Muhku"
msgstr "Muhku"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Leader, id=Irbirch
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:89
msgid "Irbirch"
msgstr "Irbirç"

#. [side]: type=Orcish Leader, id=Irbirch
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:97
msgid "Blackcrest Orcs"
msgstr "Karaibik Orkları"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Flanker, id=Ssisaix
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:107
msgid "Ssisaix"
msgstr "Ssisaiks"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Flanker, id=Ssisaix
#. [side]: type=Saurian Prophet, id=Xairr
#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:114
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:134
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:79
msgid "Blackcrest Saurians"
msgstr "Karaibik Kertenkeleleri"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Prophet, id=Xairr
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:127
msgid "Xairr"
msgstr "Ksairr"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:407
msgid "Chief Ushka'e"
msgstr "Reis Uşka'e"

#. [message]: speaker=Ushka'e
#. this is the whitefang chief. He's happy that Garard has walked into his trap
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:413
msgid ""
"You see? What did I tell you! Their king is nothing but a feeble-minded "
"goblin runt, who does exactly what I want. The trap is sprung! Now we crush "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Gördün mü? Sana ne demiştim! Kralları istediğimi aynen yapan, aklı kıt bir "
"goblin bozuntusundan başka bir şey değil. Tuzak kuruldu! Şimdi onları "
"ezeceğiz."

#. [message]: speaker=Irbirch
#. Irbirch is a representative of clan blackcrest, now (tenuously) allied with whitefang. The "spy" references Asheviere (probably; might be an agent of Iliah-Malal instead), who came up with the plan and told it to the orcs
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:435
msgid ""
"Bwahaha, when did you Whitefangs become so weak as to follow the ploy of a "
"spy? Blackcrest warriors would never have let humans advance so far into our "
"lands!"
msgstr ""
"Buhaha, siz Akdişler ne zaman bir casusun oyununa gelecek kadar "
"zayıfladınız? Karaibik savaşçıları insanların topraklarımıza bu kadar "
"ilerlemesine asla izin vermezdi!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ushka'e
#. referencing clan blackcrest's saurian allies.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:440
msgid ""
"Your “warriors” only survive by cowering behind your slimy lizard allies! "
"But since Clan Blackcrest has begged so-like trembling goblins, Clan "
"Whitefang will agree to work together."
msgstr ""
"Sizin “savaşçılarınız” ancak yapış yapış kertenkele müttefiklerinizin "
"arkasına sinerek hayatta kalıyor! Ama madem Karaibik Klanı titreyen "
"goblinler gibi yalvardı, Akdiş Klanı birlikte çalışmayı kabul edecek."

#. [message]: speaker=Irbirch
#. neither side has actually offered to work together. Subversive messengers poised as members of each clan and manipulated them into working together against Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:445
msgid ""
"Since WE begged!? YOU invited US here; your messenger was quaking in his "
"boots when he groveled before Chief Ghuvog asking for help!"
msgstr ""
"BİZ mi yalvardık!? SİZ BİZİ buraya davet ettiniz; ulağınız Reis Guvog’un "
"önünde yardım dilenirken dizleri titriyordu!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ushka'e
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:449
msgid ""
"What are you talking abo— Oh forget it, just make sure your clan does its "
"job! No human leaves this valley alive!"
msgstr ""
"Neden bahsedi— Boş ver, sadece klanının işini yapmasını sağla! Hiçbir insan "
"bu vadiden canlı çıkmayacak!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:469
msgid "Bazur"
msgstr "Bazur"

#. [message]: speaker=Bazur
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:477
msgid "Lousy chief! Lousy plan! Next time I’m doing this on my own terms!"
msgstr "Berbat reis! Berbat plan! Bir dahakine kendi bildiğim gibi yapacağım!"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. Garard has just realized he's surrounded
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:495
msgid ""
"What devilry is this? How did they sneak in behind us. I’m separated from my "
"generals and most of my soldiers..."
msgstr ""
"Bu ne şeytanlık? Arkamıza nasıl sızdılar? Generallerimden ve askerlerimin "
"çoğundan ayrı düştüm..."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:499
msgid ""
"Foul orcs, come at me then! If this is where I am to fall, I shall make such "
"a stand as to stir the gods themselves to tears!"
msgstr ""
"Pis orklar, gelin üstüme o zaman! Düşeceğim yer burasıysa öyle bir "
"direneceğim ki tanrılar bile gözyaşı dökecek!"

#. [message]: speaker=Irbirch
#. Asheviere is next to Irbirch. The player is led to think she's been captured, but it's possible she actually went of her own free will to escape Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:509
msgid ""
"Nice speech! I wonder what your wife thinks of it? Don’t worry, we’ll have "
"plenty of fun with her, <b><i>and</i></b> your unborn heir. Haw, haw, haw!"
msgstr ""
"Güzel konuşma! Acaba karın ne düşünüyor? Merak etme, onunla "
"<b><i>ve</i></b> doğmamış varisinle bol bol eğleneceğiz. Hav, hav, hav!"

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:533
msgid ""
"(aghast) That’s— They’ve captured the queen! Asheviere’s no warrior, and "
"fragile with pregnancy. We have to rescue her!"
msgstr ""
"(dehşet içinde) Bu— Kraliçeyi esir almışlar! Aşivye savaşçı değil ve "
"hamileliği yüzünden kırılgan. Onu kurtarmalıyız!"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:537
msgid ""
"Surrounded and absent the queen; this is a disaster! Quick, we must rally "
"what’s left of the crown’s infantry. Send a detachment to rescue Queen "
"Asheviere, and have the rest protect King Garard until Lionel and Arand can "
"break through to us!"
msgstr ""
"Kuşatıldık ve kraliçe yok; bu bir felaket! Çabuk, tacın piyadelerinden "
"geriye kalanları toplamalıyız. Kraliçe Aşivye’yi kurtarmak için bir müfreze "
"gönderin, geri kalanlar Lionel ve Arand yanımıza ulaşana kadar Kral "
"Garard’ı korusun!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:541
msgid "I won’t let you down! For Wesnoth!"
msgstr "Sizi hayal kırıklığına uğratmayacağım! Vesnot için!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:548
msgid "Fail to rescue Asheviere before turns run out"
msgstr "Eller bitmeden Aşivye’yi kurtaramamak"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:551
msgid "Defeat Irbirch to recapture Asheviere, then survive until turns run out"
msgstr ""
"Aşivye’yi geri almak için Irbirç’i yen, sonra eller bitene kadar hayatta kal"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:558
msgid "Survive until turns run out"
msgstr "Eller bitene kadar hayatta kal"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:587
msgid "Death of Garard, Asheviere, or Methor"
msgstr "Garard’ın, Aşivye’nin ya da Methor’un ölümü"

#. [message]: speaker=Ssisaix
#. the player (and Garard) is still alive. The orcs and saurians expected them to die by now
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:648
msgid "They ssstill sssurvive! Thisss was not the plan!"
msgstr "Hâlâ hayattalarrr! Plan bu değildi!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ushka'e
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:652
msgid ""
"Then send in more warriors and finish them off, you worthless Blackcrest "
"lizards! This is <b>our</b> homeland; our ranks swell by the hour, while "
"these humans dwindle every moment."
msgstr ""
"O zaman daha fazla savaşçı gönderin ve işlerini bitirin, sizi işe yaramaz "
"Karaibik kertenkeleleri! Burası <b>bizim</b> yurdumuz; saflarımız saat saat "
"büyüyor, bu insanlar ise her an azalıyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Ushka'e
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:658
msgid ""
"Useless lizards! Can’t even keep themselves alive, much less win a war. Send "
"in more orcs! This is <b>our</b> homeland; our ranks swell by the hour, "
"while these humans dwindle every moment."
msgstr ""
"İşe yaramaz kertenkeleler! Kendilerini hayatta tutamıyorlar bile, savaş "
"kazanmak ne gezer. Daha fazla ork gönderin! Burası <b>bizim</b> yurdumuz; "
"saflarımız saat saat büyüyor, bu insanlar ise her an azalıyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:672
msgid "They’re being reinforced!"
msgstr "Takviye alıyorlar!"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:711
msgid ""
"This alliance between races is a great ill fortune! I’ve oft known orcs to "
"recruit trolls, but seldom saurians. And with these three factions fighting "
"together, soon all the warlords will hear of their prowess."
msgstr ""
"Irklar arasındaki bu ittifak büyük bir talihsizlik! Orkların troll aldığını "
"sık sık bilirim, ama kertenkele adamları nadiren. Bu üç grup birlikte "
"savaşınca çok geçmeden bütün savaş beyleri onların kudretini duyacak."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:715
msgid ""
"It takes a great show of strength to unite the fractious orcs, but after "
"this disaster countless more will surely flock to the Blackcrest and "
"Whitefang banners. Orcs follow might above all else, even clan blood."
msgstr ""
"Huzursuz orkları birleştirmek büyük bir güç gösterisi ister, ama bu "
"felaketten sonra sayısız ork daha kesinlikle Karaibik ve Akdiş sancaklarına "
"akın edecek. Orklar her şeyden önce güce uyar, klan kanından bile önce."

#. [message]: speaker=Methor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:719
msgid ""
"Utter madness, all of this! The orcish clans are a hornet’s nest that should "
"never have been kicked. Pillagers and raids we can deal with, but total war "
"is something else entirely."
msgstr ""
"Tamamen delilik, bütün bunlar! Ork klanları asla çomak sokulmaması gereken "
"bir eşek arısı yuvası. Yağmacılar ve baskınlarla başa çıkabiliriz, ama "
"topyekûn savaş bambaşka bir şey."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:723
msgid "Quiet, both of you! If I wanted your advice I would have asked for it!"
msgstr "Susun, ikiniz de! Tavsiyenizi isteseydim sorardım!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ushka'e
#. the player has just attacked the whitefang chief. He then flees
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:735
msgid "Worthless humans! You’ll never defeat me, or clan Whitefang!"
msgstr "İşe yaramaz insanlar! Beni de Akdiş klanını da asla yenemeyeceksiniz!"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:741
msgid "Coward! Stand and fight!"
msgstr "Korkak! Dur ve savaş!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ssisaix
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:756
msgid ""
"They sssneak off to the northeassst, towardsss their queen! Ssshould I "
"pursssue?"
msgstr "Kuzeydoğuya, kraliçelerine doğru sıvışıyorlar! Peşlerine düşeyim mi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Irbirch
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:760
msgid "Finish off their king, lizard! I’ll handle things here."
msgstr "Krallarının işini bitir, kertenkele! Buradakileri ben hallederim."

#. [message]: speaker=Irbirch
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:772
msgid "Come to ransom back your queen? Too bad, she’s mine!"
msgstr "Kraliçeni fidyeyle geri almaya mı geldin? Ne yazık, o benim!"

#. [message]: speaker=Irbirch
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:776
msgid ""
"Maybe once she pops out her kid you can pay me double for both! Haw, haw, "
"haw."
msgstr ""
"Belki çocuğunu doğurunca ikisi için bana iki kat ödersin! Hav, hav, hav."

#. [message]: speaker=Irbirch
#. a representative of clan blackcrest has died
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:788
msgid ""
"Great Chief Ghuvog will avenge me! Clan Blackcrest will never rest.. until "
"Wesnoth is... razed to... ash..."
msgstr ""
"Büyük Reis Guvog intikamımı alacak! Karaibik Klanı asla durmayacak... ta ki "
"Vesnot... yerle bir... kül olana kadar..."

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#. Asheviere tries to say something, but gets interrupted
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:801
msgid "Thank yo—"
msgstr "Teşekkür ed—"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#. both Deoran and Garard talk over Asheviere. She doesn't get any agency of her own, even from Deoran (who generally stands up for her)
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:806
msgid "Not now, milady! We have to get you out of here!"
msgstr "Şimdi değil hanımefendi! Sizi buradan çıkarmalıyız!"

#. [message]: speaker=Asheviere
#. asheviere tries to say something, but gets interrupted
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:816
msgid "Garard, I—"
msgstr "Garard, ben—"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#. both Deoran and Garard talk over Asheviere. She doesn't get any agency of her own, even from Deoran (who generally stands up for her)
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:821
msgid "Not now, woman! I have a battle to fight!"
msgstr "Şimdi değil, kadın! Savaşacak bir muharebem var!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ghazgir
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:834
msgid "I’m not dying! Just... need a moment..."
msgstr "Ölmüyorum! Sadece... bir dakikaya ihtiyacım var..."

#. [message]: speaker=Mukhu
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:841
msgid "Nooo! Help meeee!"
msgstr "Hayııır! Yardım edin baaana!"

#. [message]: speaker=Xairr
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:848
msgid "Ssssuch ssssskill!"
msgstr "Ne beceri ama!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ssisaix
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:855
msgid "Cursessss, I am sssslain!"
msgstr "Lanet olsun, öldürüldüm!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#. Lionel appears with reinforcments to help Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:903
msgid ""
"Rally behind me, men! We swore our oaths, now we do our duty. Fight, fight "
"through to the king!"
msgstr ""
"Arkamda toplanın, adamlar! Yemin ettik, şimdi görevimizi yapacağız. "
"Savaşın, krala ulaşana kadar savaşın!"

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#. the player has survived, but failed ot rescue the queen
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:922
msgid ""
"But the queen! If we leave her in the hands of the orcs she’ll surely be "
"tortured and killed!"
msgstr ""
"Ama kraliçe! Onu orkların elinde bırakırsak kesinlikle işkence görüp "
"öldürülür!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:926
msgid "I’m sorry, there’s no time! We have to get the king out of here!"
msgstr "Üzgünüm, zaman yok! Kralı buradan çıkarmalıyız!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:947
msgid "Sir, look out!"
msgstr "Efendim, dikkat!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:962
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/13_Revelry_Revisited.cfg:1395
msgid "<b><i>NNnrgh!</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>NNnrgh!</i></b>"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#. Lionel has appeared with reinforcments to help Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:981
msgid ""
"By the Sceptre, I got here just in time! They caught us completely by "
"surprise. We’re holding a corridor but I don’t know for how long — we’ve got "
"to get you back to Fort Garard, sir."
msgstr ""
"Asa adına, tam zamanında yetiştim! Bizi tamamen hazırlıksız yakaladılar. "
"Bir koridoru tutuyoruz ama ne kadar dayanırız bilmiyorum — sizi Garard "
"Kalesi’ne geri götürmeliyiz, efendim."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:985
msgid "Lionel! I’d almost feared this was the end."
msgstr "Lionel! Neredeyse sonun bu olduğundan korkmuştum."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:998
msgid ""
"But how did this disaster happen? We were on the eve of victory! Did someone "
"betray our plans to the enemy? Or am I really just that predictable!?"
msgstr ""
"Ama bu felaket nasıl oldu? Zaferin eşiğindeydik! Biri planlarımızı düşmana "
"mı sızdırdı? Yoksa gerçekten bu kadar tahmin edilebilir miyim!?"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/06_Ring_of_Swords.cfg:1002
msgid ""
"Couldn’t tell you, m’lord. But there’ll be time to talk later. It looks like "
"this war is going to last a lot longer than we’d planned..."
msgstr ""
"Bilemem, efendim. Ama konuşmaya sonra vakit olur. Görünüşe göre bu savaş "
"planladığımızdan çok daha uzun sürecek..."

#. [scenario]: id=07_The_Great_River
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:29
msgid "The Great River"
msgstr "Büyük Nehir"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:40
msgid "Part II"
msgstr "II. Bölüm"

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:46
msgid ""
"The entry of Clan Blackcrest into the war opens up a new front further west, "
"demanding swift response. Wesnoth fully mobilizes, and a series of bloody "
"battles at the Ford of Abez end in deadlock for both sides. The ford is "
"heavily fortified, and river commerce grinds to a halt. Many years pass, "
"with neither side able to gain an advantage."
msgstr ""
"Karaibik Klanı’nın savaşa girmesi daha batıda yeni bir cephe açıyor ve "
"hızlı bir karşılık gerektiriyor. Vesnot tam seferberlik ilan ediyor ve Abez "
"Geçidi’ndeki bir dizi kanlı muharebe iki taraf için de çıkmazla "
"sonuçlanıyor. Geçit ağır biçimde tahkim ediliyor ve nehir ticareti duruyor. "
"Hiçbir taraf üstünlük sağlayamadan uzun yıllar geçiyor."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:50
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, Asheviere gives birth to a healthy baby boy — the Crown Prince "
"Eldred. Under heavy pressure from both parents and via the tutelage of "
"General Lionel, Eldred rapidly matures into a princeling soldier. Prince "
"Arand takes Eldred under his wing, and working in tandem the uncle and "
"nephew are able to stabilize the eastern front around Fort Garard. Whitefang "
"orcs still firmly hold the hills, but limited settlement begins."
msgstr ""
"Bu arada Aşivye sağlıklı bir erkek bebek doğuruyor — Veliaht Prens Eldred. "
"Her iki ebeveynin ağır baskısı ve General Lionel’in eğitimiyle Eldred hızla "
"bir asker prens olarak olgunlaşıyor. Prens Arand Eldred’i kanatları altına "
"alıyor ve amca ile yeğen birlikte çalışarak Garard Kalesi çevresindeki doğu "
"cephesini dengelemeyi başarıyor. Akdiş orkları hâlâ tepeleri sıkıca "
"tutuyor, ama sınırlı bir yerleşim başlıyor."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:54
msgid ""
"Delfador grows older, wiser, and significantly more powerful. He makes a "
"name for himself as the king’s premier war-mage, and quickly gains a "
"reputation as a ferocious fighter. His bold maneuvers break through orcish "
"lines several times at the Ford of Abez, but continually become stymied by "
"saurian reinforcements."
msgstr ""
"Delfador yaşlanıyor, bilgeleşiyor ve çok daha güçlü hâle geliyor. Kralın "
"baş savaş büyücüsü olarak kendine bir ad yapıyor ve hızla vahşi bir dövüşçü "
"olarak ün kazanıyor. Cesur manevraları Abez Geçidi’nde ork hatlarını birkaç "
"kez yarıyor, ama her seferinde kertenkele takviyeleri tarafından "
"engelleniyor."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:58
msgid ""
"As Wesnoth’s casualties continue to mount, and with no end in sight, "
"Delfador decides to take matters into his own hands. The war-mage prepares a "
"force of mercenary northmen to sneak behind enemy lines and determine the "
"nature of Clan Blackcrest’s orc-saurian alliance..."
msgstr ""
"Vesnot’un kayıpları artmaya devam ettikçe ve sonu görünmezken Delfador işi "
"kendi eline almaya karar veriyor. Savaş büyücüsü düşman hatlarının gerisine "
"sızıp Karaibik Klanı’nın ork-kertenkele ittifakının doğasını öğrenmek için "
"kuzeyli paralı askerlerden bir kuvvet hazırlıyor..."

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:76
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:61
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/09_Omaranth.cfg:33
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:31
msgid "Delfador’s Hirelings"
msgstr "Delfador’un Paralı Askerleri"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Ambusher, id=Ysaxis
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:89
msgid "Ysaxis"
msgstr "Ysaksis"

#. [side]: type=Saurian Ambusher, id=Ysaxis
#. [side]
#. [side]: type=Orcish Sovereign, id=Ghuvog
#. [modify_side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:93
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:102
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:111
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:176
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/11_Clan_Blackcrest.cfg:615
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/13_Revelry_Revisited.cfg:107
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/13_Revelry_Revisited.cfg:114
msgid "Clan Blackcrest"
msgstr "Karaibik Klanı"

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:114
msgid "Fish (and Beacon)"
msgstr "Balık (ve İşaret Ateşi)"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:152
msgid "Mount Oromore"
msgstr "Oromor Dağı"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:350
msgid "Lynyan"
msgstr "Linyan"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:354
msgid "Ritharran"
msgstr "Ritharran"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:374
msgid "Alright men—"
msgstr "Pekâlâ adamlar—"

#. [message]: speaker=Lynyan
#. and women
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:379
msgid "And wom’n!"
msgstr "Ve kadınlar!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. Delfador is paying these mercenaries himself; they're not wesnoth regulars
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:384
msgid ""
"—and women. I’ve selected you because you’re fast, you’re stealthy, and most "
"importantly: you work for cheap. <span size='x-small'>Lousy Eldred wouldn’t "
"give me any of my veterans.</span>"
msgstr ""
"—ve kadınlar. Sizi seçtim çünkü hızlısınız, sinsisiniz ve en önemlisi: "
"ucuza çalışıyorsunuz. <span size='x-small'>Berbat Eldred bana "
"kıdemlilerimden hiçbirini vermedi.</span>"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. cross the Great River. Not at the Ford of Abez, but near.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:389
msgid ""
"This is the perfect time for us to cross! It’s dawn, which means most of the "
"orcs and saurians will be sleeping, and there’s a heavy winter fog to cover "
"our movements. We should have time to clear this saurian outpost and sneak "
"past the frontline before the main orcish army wakes at nightfall."
msgstr ""
"Karşıya geçmemiz için mükemmel zaman! Şafak vakti, yani orkların ve "
"kertenkele adamların çoğu uyuyor olacak ve hareketlerimizi örtecek yoğun "
"bir kış sisi var. Ana ork ordusu gece çökünce uyanmadan bu kertenkele "
"karakolunu temizleyip cephe hattının ötesine sızmak için vaktimiz olmalı."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. there's a large metal brazier on a mountain filled with wood. If lit, the main orcish army will see it and come to fight Delfadaor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:394
msgid ""
"But first, our objective must be to destroy this outpost’s signal beacon."
msgstr "Ama önce hedefimiz bu karakolun işaret ateşini yok etmek olmalı."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. there's a large metal braizer on a mountain filled with wood. If lit, the main orcish army will see it and come to fight Delfadaor
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:405
msgid ""
"Even through the fog, a beacon fire that large will be visible for miles. If "
"the orcish host at the Ford of Abez is alerted before we can get through to "
"the swamp, we’ll be slaughtered!"
msgstr ""
"Sisin içinden bile o büyüklükte bir işaret ateşi kilometrelerce öteden "
"görünür. Biz bataklığa ulaşmadan Abez Geçidi’ndeki ork ordusu uyarılırsa "
"katledileceğiz!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ritharran
#. Ritharran is a rogue mage; a half-mage, half-bandit. "Hey genius, you forget there's a river there? I couldn't swim that far even if it weren't the middle of winter"
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:410
msgid ""
"Hey genius, you forget about the river? I got expelled long before learning "
"how to levitate, and the girl ’haint swimming that far even if’t it weren’t "
"the middle of winter."
msgstr ""
"Hey dâhi, nehri unuttun mu? Ben havalanmayı öğrenmeden çok önce okuldan "
"atıldım, kız da kışın ortası olmasa bile o kadar uzağa yüzemez."

#. [message]: speaker=Ritharran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:422
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "Ah."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:430
msgid "Destroy the signal beacon"
msgstr "İşaret ateşini yok et"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:434
msgid "Don’t be seen by a goblin or saurian during their turn"
msgstr "Goblinlerin ya da kertenkele adamların sırasında onlara görünme"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:438
msgid "Then, defeat all enemies"
msgstr "Sonra bütün düşmanları yen"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:442
msgid "A goblin or saurian sees you during their turn"
msgstr "Bir goblin ya da kertenkele adam kendi sırasında seni görür"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:454
msgid "Moving past or killing enemies on your turn will not raise the alarm."
msgstr ""
"Kendi sıranda düşmanların yanından geçmek ya da onları öldürmek alarm "
"vermez."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:466
msgid ""
"Your regular soldiers cannot sneak north with you, but you can instead "
"recruit Footpads, Thieves, and Rogue Mages!\n"
"\n"
"Footpads are quick-but-fragile scouts, with equally weak melee and ranged "
"attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Thieves trade the footpad’s ranged attack for improved melee damage, and are "
"particularly deadly when attacking an enemy from behind.\n"
"\n"
"Rogue Mages are fragile fighters with both physical and magical attacks."
msgstr ""
"Normal askerlerin seninle kuzeye sızamaz, ama onların yerine Kapkaççı, "
"Hırsız ve Kaçak Büyücü alabilirsin!\n"
"\n"
"Kapkaççılar hızlı ama kırılgan keşif birimleridir; yakın dövüş ve menzilli "
"saldırıları eşit derecede zayıftır.\n"
"\n"
"Hırsızlar kapkaççının menzilli saldırısı yerine daha güçlü yakın dövüş "
"hasarına sahiptir ve bir düşmana arkadan saldırırken özellikle ölümcüldür.\n"
"\n"
"Kaçak Büyücüler hem fiziksel hem büyülü saldırıları olan kırılgan "
"dövüşçülerdir."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. the player has spotted a goblin or saurian on lookout duty
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:604
msgid ""
"Take care! If that guard spots us on its turn, it’ll alert all the others."
msgstr "Dikkat! O nöbetçi kendi sırasında bizi görürse diğerlerini uyarır."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:687
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:701
msgid "Fog and Vision:"
msgstr "Sis ve Görüş:"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:688
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:702
msgid ""
"In fog, units (including yours) can see 1 hex further than their movement."
msgstr ""
"Siste birimler (seninkiler dahil) hareketlerinden 1 altıgen daha uzağı "
"görebilir."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:690
msgid ""
"For this scenario, we’ve highlighted which hexes the goblins and saurians "
"can see.\n"
"If you end your turn in vision of a living goblin or saurian, you’ll lose "
"the scenario!\n"
"Moving past or killing enemies on your turn will not raise the alarm."
msgstr ""
"Bu senaryo için goblinlerin ve kertenkele adamların görebildiği altıgenleri "
"vurguladık.\n"
"Elini canlı bir goblin ya da kertenkele adamın görüş alanında bitirirsen "
"senaryoyu kaybedersin!\n"
"Kendi sıranda düşmanların yanından geçmek ya da onları öldürmek alarm "
"vermez."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:694
msgid ""
"With the right spells and strategy, this scenario (like all campaigns) can "
"be completed\n"
"<i><b>without relying on luck or risky attacks.</b></i>"
msgstr ""
"Doğru büyüler ve stratejiyle bu senaryo (bütün seferberlikler gibi)\n"
"<i><b>şansa ya da riskli saldırılara güvenmeden</b></i> tamamlanabilir."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:704
msgid ""
"On lower difficulties, this scenario specially highlights which hexes\n"
"are in enemy vision. Because you’re playing on the highest difficulty,\n"
"you’ll have to keep track on your own."
msgstr ""
"Düşük zorluklarda bu senaryo düşman görüşündeki altıgenleri\n"
"özel olarak vurgular. En yüksek zorlukta oynadığın için\n"
"bunları kendin takip etmen gerekecek."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:708
msgid ""
"With the right spells and strategy, this scenario (like all campaigns)\n"
"can be completed <i><b>without relying on luck or risky attacks.</b></i>"
msgstr ""
"Doğru büyüler ve stratejiyle bu senaryo (bütün seferberlikler gibi)\n"
"<i><b>şansa ya da riskli saldırılara güvenmeden</b></i> tamamlanabilir."

#. [message]: speaker=Lynyan
#. that one's patrolling back and forth! Those lizards are ugly
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:726
msgid "That one’s patrollin’ back an’ forth! Those lizards sure are ugly..."
msgstr "Şu ileri geri devriye geziyo’! Şu kertenkeleler amma çirkin..."

#. [message]: speaker=$unit
#. an enemy has died swiftly, without making much noise
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:740
msgid "Urk—"
msgstr "Urk—"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:744
msgid ""
"Excellent! That one perished swiftly, before it had a chance to raise the "
"alarm."
msgstr "Harika! O alarm verme fırsatı bulamadan hızla can verdi."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:756
msgid "We must move swiftly! The fog is already starting to clear."
msgstr "Hızlı hareket etmeliyiz! Sis şimdiden dağılmaya başladı."

#. [message]: speaker=$unit.id
#. [message]: speaker=Ysaxis
#. presumably these saurians have fought Delfador before. They recognize him even if he's polymorphed
#. look, it's that wizard again! Light the fire, sound the alarm.
#. look, it's that wizard again! Light the fire, sound the alarm.
#. look, it's that wizard again! Light the fire, sound the alarm.
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:839
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:879
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:899
msgid "Look, it’sss that wisssard again! Light the fire, sssound the alarm!"
msgstr "Bakın, yine o büyücü! Ateşi yakın, alarmı çalın!"

#. [message]: speaker=$unit.id
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:845
msgid "Look, it’s that wizard again! Light the fire, sound the alarm!"
msgstr "Bakın, yine o büyücü! Ateşi yakın, alarmı çalın!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:868
msgid "The beacon is destroyed! And just in time too: the fog is lifting."
msgstr "İşaret ateşi yok edildi! Hem de tam zamanında: sis kalkıyor."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:888
msgid "I’ve tarried too long, the fog is already clearing!"
msgstr "Çok oyalandım, sis şimdiden dağılıyor!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:916
msgid ""
"We’ve been spotted, and soon this outpost will be swarming with orcs! I hate "
"running from a fight, but we have to retreat..."
msgstr ""
"Görüldük ve çok geçmeden bu karakol orklarla dolup taşacak! Bir savaştan "
"kaçmaktan nefret ederim, ama geri çekilmeliyiz..."

#. [message]: speaker=Ysaxis
#. Ysaxis is ordering his minions to light the beacon fire, but there's nobody left to light the beacon
#. I said, light the fire!
#. Ysaxis is ordering his minions to light the beacon fire, but the beacon is destroyed
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:927
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:938
msgid "I sssaid, light the fire!"
msgstr "Ateşi yakın dedim!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:930
msgid ""
"Cursssesss, the mountain guards are ssslain, and the beacon cannot be "
"reached!"
msgstr "Lanet olsun, dağ nöbetçileri öldürüldü ve işaret ateşine ulaşılamıyor!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:940
msgid "Cursssesss, the beacon is destroyed and the orcs still slumber!"
msgstr "Lanet olsun, işaret ateşi yok edildi ve orklar hâlâ uyuyor!"

#. [message]: role=goblin1
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:962
msgid "Eeek! It’s gone!"
msgstr "Iyy! Gitti!"

#. [message]: speaker=Ysaxis
#. no matter, my saurains will slip past and warn the army! Everyone, escape to the west!
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:968
msgid ""
" No matter, my sssaurians will ssslip past and warn the army! Everyone, "
"essscape to the west!"
msgstr ""
" Önemli değil, kertenkele adamlarım sıvışıp orduyu uyaracak! Herkes batıya "
"kaçsın!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#. saurians are trying to run past Delfador's army and get orcs to come fight Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:974
msgid ""
"They’re making a run for it! Don’t let a single one get away, or this "
"outpost will be swarming with orcs!"
msgstr ""
"Kaçmaya çalışıyorlar! Tek birinin bile kaçmasına izin vermeyin, yoksa bu "
"karakol orklarla dolup taşar!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1032
msgid "Defeat enemies before any escape"
msgstr "Herhangi biri kaçmadan düşmanları yen"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1036
msgid "Any enemy reaches the west edge of the map"
msgstr "Herhangi bir düşman haritanın batı kenarına ulaşır"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1054
msgid "Reselecting Spells:"
msgstr "Büyüleri Yeniden Seçme:"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1055
msgid ""
"Because the scenario’s objectives have significantly changed (in a way you "
"couldn’t have anticipated at the scenario’s start), you now have the option "
"to change your spells."
msgstr ""
"Senaryonun hedefleri önemli ölçüde değiştiği için (senaryonun başında "
"öngöremeyeceğin bir şekilde), artık büyülerini değiştirme seçeneğin var."

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1070
msgid ""
"We must defeat these saurians and escape before nightfall, or the main "
"orcish camp will wake and be upon us!"
msgstr ""
"Gece çökmeden bu kertenkele adamları yenip kaçmalıyız, yoksa ana ork kampı "
"uyanıp üstümüze çullanır!"

#. [message]: speaker=$unit
#. I have escaped!
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1083
msgid "I have essscaped!"
msgstr "Kaçtım!"

#. [message]: speaker=$unit
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1084
msgid "female^I have essscaped!"
msgstr "Kaçtım!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1088
msgid ""
"One of them has gotten away to warn the orcish army! I hate running from a "
"fight, but we have to retreat..."
msgstr ""
"Biri ork ordusunu uyarmak için kaçtı! Bir savaştan kaçmaktan nefret ederim, "
"ama geri çekilmeliyiz..."

#. [message]: type=Orcish Warlord
#. an orc has just woken up and found Delfador fighting saurians
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1105
msgid "<i>Yaawwnn</i> ...what’s all this noise about?"
msgstr "<i>Haaayyy</i> ...bu gürültü de ne?"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1109
msgid ""
"We’ve taken too long, now it’s nighttime and the orcish camp has awoken! I "
"hate running from a fight, but we have to retreat..."
msgstr ""
"Çok uzun sürdü, artık gece oldu ve ork kampı uyandı! Bir savaştan kaçmaktan "
"nefret ederim, ama geri çekilmeliyiz..."

#. [message]: speaker=Ysaxis
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1127
msgid "Cursssesss..."
msgstr "Lanet olsun..."

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1138
msgid "Ah-ha, got you!"
msgstr "Aha, yakaladım seni!"

#. [message]: speaker=Delfador
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07_The_Great_River.cfg:1141
msgid ""
"Victory is won! We have done well to remain undetected — the way forward "
"remains clear. Now onwards to the Swamp of Dread, to find out why these "
"saurians are fighting alongside orcs..."
msgstr ""
"Zafer kazanıldı! Fark edilmeden kalmayı iyi başardık — önümüzdeki yol açık. "
"Şimdi bu kertenkele adamların neden orklarla yan yana savaştığını öğrenmek "
"için Dehşet Bataklığı’na..."

#. [scenario]: id=07x_Weldyn_Court
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:6
msgid "Weldyn Court"
msgstr "Weldyn Sarayı"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:106
msgid ""
"“<i>Barren Throne</i>”, “<i>Angel of Ashes</i>”; don’t people have better "
"things to do than gossip all day about this vapid prophecy? I put my trust "
"in steel, not seers."
msgstr ""
"“<i>Çorak Taht</i>”, “<i>Küllerin Meleği</i>”; insanların bütün gün bu boş "
"kehanet hakkında dedikodu yapmaktan daha iyi işleri yok mu? Ben kâhinlere "
"değil çeliğe güvenirim."

#. [message]: speaker=Deoran
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:110
msgid "My Liege, I fear you give insufficient weight to—"
msgstr "Efendim, korkarım yeterince önem vermiyorsunuz—"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:114
msgid ""
"And “<i>Sceptre of the Wesfolk</i>” is the worst of it all... as if it’s my "
"fault Haldric’s dwarves lost the accursed thing."
msgstr ""
"Hele “<i>Batı Halkının Asası</i>” en kötüsü... sanki Haldrik’in cücelerinin "
"o lanet şeyi kaybetmesi benim suçummuş gibi."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:116
msgid ""
"Even the wife! Ever since Delfador first told us about that prophecy, all I "
"get from Asheviere is gossip; rumors about nobles and expeditions and "
"treasure-seekers and other such nonsense. What do you make of it all, "
"brother?"
msgstr ""
"Karım bile! Delfador bize o kehaneti ilk anlattığından beri Aşivye’den tek "
"duyduğum dedikodu; soylular, keşif seferleri, define avcıları ve buna "
"benzer saçmalıklar hakkında söylentiler. Sen bütün bunlardan ne anlıyorsun, "
"kardeşim?"

#. [message]: speaker=Arand
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:120
msgid ""
"The Sceptre of Fire may have gone missing years ago, but it is still well-"
"known as Wesnoth’s symbol of kingship, among lords and common-folk alike."
msgstr ""
"Ateş Asası yıllar önce kaybolmuş olabilir, ama hâlâ hem beyler hem halk "
"arasında Vesnot’un krallık simgesi olarak iyi bilinir."

#. [message]: speaker=Arand
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:122
msgid ""
"My spies have heard nothing of these sceptre-hunters. But if they are real "
"and a noble actually manages to find and retrieve the Sceptre, well, such a "
"misfortune could put your claim to the throne in serious jeopardy."
msgstr ""
"Casuslarım bu asa avcıları hakkında hiçbir şey duymadı. Ama gerçeklerse ve "
"bir soylu Asa’yı bulup geri getirmeyi başarırsa, işte böyle bir talihsizlik "
"taht üzerindeki hakkını ciddi tehlikeye atabilir."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:126
msgid ""
"Intrigue and influence, politics and loyalty. I’m lucky to have you, Arand. "
"This isn’t my strength."
msgstr ""
"Entrika ve nüfuz, siyaset ve sadakat. Sana sahip olduğum için şanslıyım, "
"Arand. Bu benim güçlü yanım değil."

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:130
msgid ""
"But I use the tools I have. Take General Lionel — there’s a man to rely on! "
"He’s served me loyally for many years; why, I practically trust him more "
"than my own son!"
msgstr ""
"Ama elimdeki araçları kullanırım. General Lionel’i ele al — işte "
"güvenilecek bir adam! Yıllardır bana sadakatle hizmet etti; hatta neredeyse "
"ona kendi oğlumdan daha çok güveniyorum!"

#. [message]: speaker=Lionel
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:134
msgid "(bows)"
msgstr "(eğilir)"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:138
msgid "No offense, boy."
msgstr "Alınma, evlat."

#. [message]: speaker=Eldred
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:142
msgid "(scowls)"
msgstr "(kaşlarını çatar)"

#. [message]: speaker=Garard
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/07x_Weldyn_Court.cfg:146
msgid "Still, these rumors cannot be taken lightly. Something must be done...."
msgstr "Yine de bu söylentiler hafife alınamaz. Bir şeyler yapılmalı...."

#. [scenario]: id=08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:42
msgid "Ruins of Saurgrath"
msgstr "Saurgrath Harabeleri"

#. [trait]: id=aged2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:89
msgid "aged"
msgstr "yaşlı"

#. [trait]: id=aged2
#: data/campaigns/The_Deceivers_Gambit/scenarios/08_Ruins_of_Saurgrath.cfg:90
